{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Udt7CXMRtUnQFBiBKXzo4U","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '贡献权重需重新平衡。C1校准降级为proof-of-concept：仅在强污染效应条件 （1.5B/3B高dosage且format不mismatch的benchmark）上展示有效性，弱效应条件下\n2\t  报告CI重叠并讨论统计功效不足。C2删除\"scale-dependent\"改为\"method-specific signal effectiveness\"——S2/S4在1.5B/3B仍然AUC≈0.5，与0.5B一致，RRF实质退化为\n3\t  S1单信号。Min-K++反向效应(Cohen''s d=-1.2~-2.7)和item-vs-model detection 区分仍是最强引用贡献，独立于scale结果。RRF讨论移至Limitations但保留\n4\t  meta-circularity论证。C3 Fisher Info identifiability升为co-lead——在N=24-30 处于可辨识性下限的条件下，提供\"何时可信任校准\"的理论框架。论文重心从\n5\t  \"calibration framework\"转向\"signal characterization + identifiability boundaries +\n6\t  calibration proof-of-concept\"。标题调整为 \"Understanding and Calibrating Benchmark Contamination\n7\t  in LLMs\"。 关键风险：0.5B catastrophic forgetting(d100 MMLU从0.40降至0.23)干扰γ估计， 需排除或单独建模；3B\n8\t  GSM8K d000=0.12的eval格式问题导致表面57pp inflation 实为artifact，必须修复或排除。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n13\t  plan_id: exp-002\n14\t  description: '在exp-001产出的全部0.5B/1.5B/3B×5 dosage模型上计算4个检测信号： S1(embedding retrieval),\n15\t    S2(Min-K%++), S3(ConStat), S4(Self-Critique)。 输出per-model-item exposure scores。1.5B/3B为新增计算。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    S1_embedding_d005_auc_05B: 0.979\n20\t    S1_embedding_d005_auc_15B: 0.971\n21\t    S1_embedding_d005_auc_3B: 0.965\n22\t    S2_minkpp_d005_auc_05B: 0.465\n23\t    S2_minkpp_d005_auc_15B: 0.503\n24\t    S2_minkpp_d005_auc_3B: 0.538\n25\t    S3_constat_d005_auc_05B: 0.52\n26\t    S3_constat_d005_auc_15B: 0.61\n27\t    S3_constat_d005_auc_3B: 0.64\n28\t    S4_selfcritique_d005_auc_05B: 0.481\n29\t    S4_selfcritique_d005_auc_15B: 0.505\n30\t    S4_selfcritique_d005_auc_3B: 0.523\n31\t    S2_minkpp_d100_cohens_d_mean: -1.98\n32\t    S2_reversal_confirmed_at_15B: true\n33\t    S2_reversal_confirmed_at_3B: true\n34\t    effective_signals_at_15B: 1\n35\t    effective_signals_at_3B: 1\n36\t    compute_hours_actual: 18\n37\t  result_rationale: 'S1(embedding retrieval)是model-agnostic的：用预训练sentence-transformer\n38\t    计算训练数据与benchmark item的余弦相似度，不依赖目标模型的logit分布， 因此AUC在三个scale上几乎恒定（0.96-0.98）。0.5B已实测0.979。\n39\t\n40\t    S2(Min-K%++)依赖模型logit分布中的membership inference信号。0.5B实测 AUC=0.465（低于chance）。在1.5B/3B上，更大的模型有更平滑的logit分布，\n41\t    MIA的理论信噪比应改善——但0.5B的失败不是SNR不足，而是SFT后logit分布 发生结构性重整(catastrophic forgetting at\n42\t    0.5B, distribution shift at all scales)，使Min-K++的\"低概率token\"假设失效。1.5B/3B模型capacity更大\n43\t    forgetting更轻，可能有边际改善(0.50→0.54)但不足以达到useful threshold (AUC≥0.70)。这与MIA文献一致——Shokri\n44\t    et al. 2017发现MIA在小模型上 信号弱，但SFT场景与标准MIA的train/test partition不同。\n45\t\n46\t    S2的directional reversal(Cohen''s d=-1.2~-2.7 at d100)在1.5B/3B应持续： d100将全部benchmark\n47\t    item注入SFT数据，模型logit分布整体偏移，Min-K++ 在contaminated model上反而给出更低的\"anomaly\"分数。这是Min-K++作为\n48\t    contamination detector的结构性缺陷，与scale无关。\n49\t\n50\t    S3(ConStat)计算原始vs改写item的performance gap。在1.5B/3B上模型 足够强以展示contamination-induced\n51\t    performance gap（d005条件下contaminated items accuracy高于paraphrased versions），AUC可达0.61-0.64。但\n52\t    0.5B模型accuracy太低（MMLU 0.40），原始/改写差异被noise淹没。 S3是median tier中唯一\"接近useful但不达标\"的信号。\n53\t\n54\t    S4(Self-Critique)需要模型有足够的meta-cognitive能力来检测自身memorization。 0.5B实测AUC=0.481。1.5B/3B的Self-Critique能力更强，但SFT后的entropy\n55\t    collapse pattern在所有scale上相似——模型memorize了item后对原始和改写 version的entropy差异不够大。AUC从0.48提升到0.52左右。\n56\t\n57\t    总结：在所有三个scale上只有S1是effective signal(AUC>0.70)。 这直接支持median tier的核心假设——RRF退化为单信号模式。\n58\t\n59\t    '\n60\t  tables:\n61\t  - name: Signal AUC Heatmap (d005, within-model)\n62\t    columns:\n63\t    - Signal\n64\t    - 0.5B_MMLU\n65\t    - 0.5B_GSM8K\n66\t    - 0.5B_ARC\n67\t    - 1.5B_MMLU\n68\t    - 1.5B_GSM8K\n69\t    - 1.5B_ARC\n70\t    - 3B_MMLU\n71\t    - 3B_GSM8K\n72\t    - 3B_ARC\n73\t    rows:\n74\t    - - S1_Embed\n75\t      - 0.953\n76\t      - 0.988\n77\t      - 0.995\n78\t      - 0.962\n79\t      - 0.978\n80\t      - 0.99\n81\t      - 0.955\n82\t      - 0.973\n83\t      - 0.988\n84\t    - - S2_MinKPP\n85\t      - 0.465\n86\t      - 0.465\n87\t      - 0.466\n88\t      - 0.498\n89\t      - 0.51\n90\t      - 0.502\n91\t      - 0.53\n92\t      - 0.545\n93\t      - 0.538\n94\t    - - S3_ConStat\n95\t      - 0.52\n96\t      - 0.51\n97\t      - 0.53\n98\t      - 0.6\n99\t      - 0.58\n100\t      - 0.65\n101\t      - 0.63\n102\t      - 0.61\n103\t      - 0.68\n104\t    - - S4_SelfCrit\n105\t      - 0.517\n106\t      - 0.495\n107\t      - 0.432\n108\t      - 0.51\n109\t      - 0.498\n110\t      - 0.508\n111\t      - 0.528\n112\t      - 0.515\n113\t      - 0.525\n114\t  - name: Cross-model Cohen's d (d100 vs d000)\n115\t    columns:\n116\t    - Signal\n117\t    - 0.5B_MMLU\n118\t    - 0.5B_GSM8K\n119\t    - 0.5B_ARC\n120\t    - 1.5B_MMLU\n121\t    - 1.5B_GSM8K\n122\t    - 1.5B_ARC\n123\t    - 3B_MMLU\n124\t    - 3B_GSM8K\n125\t    - 3B_ARC\n126\t    rows:\n127\t    - - S1_Embed\n128\t      - 4.16\n129\t      - 2.83\n130\t      - 3.8\n131\t      - 3.92\n132\t      - 2.65\n133\t      - 3.55\n134\t      - 3.78\n135\t      - 2.51\n136\t      - 3.42\n137\t    - - S2_MinKPP\n138\t      - -1.22\n139\t      - -2.67\n140\t      - -2.05\n141\t      - -1.35\n142\t      - -2.81\n143\t      - -2.18\n144\t      - -1.48\n145\t      - -2.93\n146\t      - -2.3\n147\t    - - S3_ConStat\n148\t      - 0.35\n149\t      - 0.18\n150\t      - 0.42\n151\t      - 0.82\n152\t      - 0.55\n153\t      - 0.95\n154\t      - 0.9\n155\t      - 0.62\n156\t      - 1.05\n157\t    - - S4_SelfCrit\n158\t      - 0.47\n159\t      - 0.2\n160\t      - 0.67\n161\t      - 0.55\n162\t      - 0.28\n163\t      - 0.75\n164\t      - 0.62\n165\t      - 0.35\n166\t      - 0.82\n167\t  figures_description:\n168\t  - '4×3 AUC heatmap (signal × benchmark), 三个panel对应0.5B/1.5B/3B。S1全红(>0.95), S2/S4全蓝(<0.55),\n169\t    S3 1.5B/3B浅橙(0.58-0.68)。视觉上一目了然: 只有embedding信号在所有条件下有效。'\n170\t  - Min-K++ reversal可视化：每个benchmark一个subplot，x轴=dosage，y轴=mean signal score。d000和d100的分布boxplot重叠展示，标注Cohen's\n171\t    d。d100方向始终反转（负d），1.5B/3B效应与0.5B方向一致但magnitude略大。\n172\t  analysis: 'S2/S4在1.5B/3B的持续失败将C2从\"scale-dependent signal effectiveness\" 降级为\"method-specific\n173\t    signal effectiveness\"——scale不是区分因素。 S3(ConStat)在1.5B/3B达到0.61-0.64的marginal AUC，有一定信息量但不足以\n174\t    在RRF中实质改善S1。论文应当明确报告：当前4信号中仅S1可靠，C2的 empirical贡献在于(a)文档化这一failure mode供后续研究者避免，\n175\t    (b)Min-K++反向效应作为cautionary finding。\n176\t\n177\t    '\n178\t- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n179\t  plan_id: exp-003\n180\t  description: 'RRF融合4信号为composite per-item exposure score。消融： (a) RRF vs equal-weight\n181\t    rank averaging, (b) single-signal only ×4, (c) calibration-weighted RRF, (d) FP\n182\t    injection robustness, (e) 2-signal degraded mode。\n183\t\n184\t    '\n185\t  expected_results:\n186\t    rrf_4signal_auc_d005_mean: 0.932\n187\t    s1_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.979\n188\t    rrf_vs_s1_delta: -0.047\n189\t    equal_weight_rank_avg_auc: 0.918\n190\t    calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.951\n191\t    s2_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.502\n192\t    s3_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.617\n193\t    s4_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.506\n194\t    degraded_2signal_auc: 0.568\n195\t    fp_injection_5pct_auc_delta: -0.02\n196\t    fp_injection_10pct_auc_delta: -0.05\n197\t    fp_injection_20pct_auc_delta: -0.12\n198\t  result_rationale: 'RRF将4个信号的rank进行倒数融合。当3/4信号是noise(AUC≈0.50)时， noise信号的rank本质是random\n199\t    permutation，融合后相当于对S1 rank添加了 uniform noise。具体地：RRF score = 1/(k+r_S1) + 1/(k+r_S2)\n200\t    + 1/(k+r_S3) + 1/(k+r_S4)， 其中r_S2, r_S3(at 0.5B), r_S4接近random。这等价于对S1 signal施加了\n201\t    ~25%权重的均匀噪声扰动，导致AUC从0.979降到~0.93。\n202\t\n203\t    S1-only严格优于RRF 4-signal（Δ≈-4.7pp AUC），直接支持reviewer concern #18 \"why not just S1\"。这是median\n204\t    tier最关键的实验结果之一。\n205\t\n206\t    Calibration-weighted RRF根据held-out AUC对各信号加权，有效降低noise信号权重。 在极端情况下（S2/S4权重趋近0）退化为S1+S3\n207\t    weighted，AUC恢复到0.95左右。 但引入了circularity——权重校准需要labeled data，与meta-circularity argument冲突。\n208\t\n209\t    2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+Self-Critique, 无logits/embeddings)： 两个信号AUC均<0.65，融合后AUC≈0.57——不足以支撑可靠校准。\n210\t    这对closed-weight model适用性是坏消息。\n211\t\n212\t    FP injection robustness：在5%/10%/20% false positive率下，S1的AUC本身 下降有限（embedding retrieval的FP主要是语义相似但非contaminated的item），\n213\t    但RRF更脆弱——noise信号的FP和真实FP叠加后扰动更大。\n214\t\n215\t    '\n216\t  tables:\n217\t  - name: RRF Ablation Results (d005, averaged across benchmarks)\n218\t    columns:\n219\t    - Method\n220\t    - AUC_mean\n221\t    - AUC_std\n222\t    - vs_S1_only\n223\t    rows:\n224\t    - - S1 Embedding only\n225\t      - 0.979\n226\t      - 0.018\n227\t      - —\n228\t    - - S2 Min-K++ only\n229\t      - 0.502\n230\t      - 0.032\n231\t      - '-0.477'\n232\t    - - S3 ConStat only\n233\t      - 0.617\n234\t      - 0.035\n235\t      - '-0.362'\n236\t    - - S4 Self-Critique only\n237\t      - 0.506\n238\t      - 0.04\n239\t      - '-0.473'\n240\t    - - RRF 4-signal (default k=60)\n241\t      - 0.932\n242\t      - 0.022\n243\t      - '-0.047'\n244\t    - - Equal-weight rank average\n245\t      - 0.918\n246\t      - 0.025\n247\t      - '-0.061'\n248\t    - - Calibration-weighted RRF\n249\t      - 0.951\n250\t      - 0.02\n251\t      - '-0.028'\n252\t    - - 2-signal degraded (S3+S4)\n253\t      - 0.568\n254\t      - 0.038\n255\t      - '-0.411'\n256\t  - name: FP Injection Robustness\n257\t    columns:\n258\t    - FP_rate\n259\t    - RRF_4sig_AUC\n260\t    - S1_only_AUC\n261\t    - RRF_delta\n262\t    - S1_delta\n263\t    rows:\n264\t    - - 0% (baseline)\n265\t      - 0.932\n266\t      - 0.979\n267\t      - —\n268\t      - —\n269\t    - - 5%\n270\t      - 0.912\n271\t      - 0.971\n272\t      - -0.02\n273\t      - -0.008\n274\t    - - 10%\n275\t      - 0.882\n276\t      - 0.958\n277\t      - -0.05\n278\t      - -0.021\n279\t    - - 20%\n280\t      - 0.812\n281\t      - 0.935\n282\t      - -0.12\n283\t      - -0.044\n284\t  figures_description:\n285\t  - 'Bar chart: 6 aggregation methods的AUC对比，S1 only用虚线标注为upper bound。RRF 4-signal明显低于S1\n286\t    only，calibration-weighted RRF接近但不达。2-signal degraded mode远低于usable threshold(0.70虚线)。'\n287\t  analysis: 'RRF ≤ S1-only是median tier的关键结果。论文处理策略： (1) 主表报告S1-only作为primary exposure\n288\t    input进IRT； (2) RRF讨论移至Limitations，保留meta-circularity argument 解释为何选择training-free\n289\t    aggregation而非learned weighting； (3) 框架定位为\"extensible architecture\"——当未来有更好信号时\n290\t    RRF自然受益，当前降级为S1+IRT不损害方法论贡献； (4) reviewer concern #18 \"why not just S1\"的回答：S1-only\n291\t    IS our primary result，RRF是为multi-signal可用时准备的架构。\n292\t\n293\t    '\n294\t- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n295\t  plan_id: exp-006\n296\t  description: '在exp-001/003模型上拟合4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS)。Primary: per-benchmark γ_k\n297\t    fitting。Ablation: joint fitting with shared γ。7个baselines对比。 N_models≈24-30 (3\n298\t    scales × 4 dosages × 2 seeds)。\n299\t\n300\t    '\n301\t  expected_results:\n302\t    n_models_pooled: 26\n303\t    mae_contam_cal_pp_mmlu: 3.8\n304\t    mae_contam_cal_pp_arc: 4.1\n305\t    mae_contam_cal_pp_gsm8k: 5.2\n306\t    mae_contam_cal_pp_humaneval: 6.8\n307\t    mae_contam_cal_pp_avg: 4.2\n308\t    mae_improvement_vs_best_baseline_pp: 0.7\n309\t    ci_coverage_95pct_mmlu: 85\n310\t    ci_coverage_95pct_arc: 83\n311\t    ci_coverage_95pct_gsm8k: 88\n312\t    ci_coverage_95pct_avg: 85\n313\t    ci_coverage_80pct_avg: 74\n314\t    ci_coverage_50pct_avg: 45\n315\t    ci_sharpness_avg_width_pp: 11.3\n316\t    kendall_tau_mmlu: 0.82\n317\t    kendall_tau_arc: 0.79\n318\t    kendall_tau_gsm8k: 0.78\n319\t    kendall_tau_avg: 0.8\n320\t    gamma_k_mmlu_mean: 0.28\n321\t    gamma_k_mmlu_sd: 0.14\n322\t    gamma_k_mmlu_ci95:\n323\t    - -0.01\n324\t    - 0.56\n325\t    gamma_k_arc_mean: 0.22\n326\t    gamma_k_arc_sd: 0.16\n327\t    gamma_k_arc_ci95:\n328\t    - -0.1\n329\t    - 0.53\n330\t    gamma_k_gsm8k_mean: 0.45\n331\t    gamma_k_gsm8k_sd: 0.11\n332\t    gamma_k_gsm8k_ci95:\n333\t    - 0.23\n334\t    - 0.67\n335\t    gamma_excludes_zero_rate: 0.625\n336\t    gamma_excludes_zero_benchmarks:\n337\t    - GSM8K\n338\t    - possibly MMLU at high dosage\n339\t    dose_response_monotonicity_violations: 2\n340\t    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.04\n341\t    max_rhat: 1.008\n342\t    min_ess_bulk: 580\n343\t    divergent_pct: 0.3\n344\t    me_model_coverage_delta_vs_simple: 2.5\n345\t    me_model_primary: false\n346\t    fit_time_per_benchmark_min: 45\n347\t  result_rationale: \"N_models=26 (3 scales × {d000,d005,d025,d100} × 2 seeds, 减去0.5B\\\n348\t    \\ d025 seed2缺失和个别failed eval)处于exp-004确认的identifiability下限。 在AUC≈0.97(S1的effective\\\n349\t    \\ item-level AUC)和N=26条件下，Fisher Info analysis预测γ posterior SD约0.12-0.16。\\nγ_k\\\n350\t    \\ per-benchmark heterogeneity： - MMLU: 1.5B/3B的contamination inflation很小(+0.8~1.7pp)，0.5B是\\n\\\n351\t    \\  catastrophic forgetting(−16.5pp)。IRT模型看到的是item-level效应：\\n  contaminated items在高dosage模型上的正确率是否系统性高于\\n\\\n352\t    \\  uncontaminated items。即使model-level inflation小，如果被contaminate的\\n  specific items确实变容易了，γ仍可为正。但0.5B\\\n353\t    \\ forgetting数据拉低\\n  整体估计。γ_mmlu posterior宽(CI包含0)，mean约0.28。\\n- ARC: 类似MMLU——1.5B/3B\\\n354\t    \\ inflation≤1.5pp，效应弱。γ_arc CI更宽，\\n  可能包含0。\\n- GSM8K: 3B存在严重eval format artifact(d000=0.12\\\n355\t    \\ vs raw baseline 0.60)。\\n  如果排除3B GSM8K或修复eval，1.5B的GSM8K inflation仅1.5pp。\\n\\\n356\t    \\  但如果保留3B数据，表面57pp \\\"inflation\\\"会让γ_gsm8k估计偏高且misleading。\\n  假设正确处理后(排除3B GSM8K\\\n357\t    \\ format issue)，GSM8K的γ仍然最大\\n  (0.45±0.11)因为1.5B d100 HumanEval +17.7pp的spillover效应。\\n\\\n358\t    \\  实际上GSM8K contamination效应可能来自format learning而非memorization。\\n\\nγ CI excludes\\\n359\t    \\ zero的比例约62.5%(5/8个benchmark-dosage组合中仅GSM8K 和个别高dosage MMLU条件下排除0)。这低于optimistic但符合median\\\n360\t    \\ tier。\\nCoverage gap: 95% CI coverage 85% vs nominal 95%。exp-004 simulation在\\\n361\t    \\ N=20-50时也观察到undercoverage(80-90%)。原因：(1) local independence violation——单个model的14K\\\n362\t    \\ item responses通过shared parameters相关， 有效N_items远小于名义值；(2) 0.5B forgetting数据与1.5B/3B\\\n363\t    \\ inflation 数据方向相反，single γ_k无法同时拟合两个pattern。 ME model仅提升coverage ~2.5pp(从82.5→85)——exp-005显示ME\\\n364\t    \\ model gamma bias 59%，ME模型本身引入新的bias source。\\nMAE 4.2pp avg： - MMLU: ground truth\\\n365\t    \\ inflation <2pp at 1.5B/3B → calibrated score和\\n  true score很接近，MAE主要来自0.5B数据的forgetting+noise\\\n366\t    \\ → 3.8pp\\n- ARC: 类似 → 4.1pp - GSM8K: 如果包含3B artifact数据则MAE高；排除后1.5B inflation\\\n367\t    \\ 1.5pp\\n  但model的calibrated score对该小效应的correction不够精确 → 5.2pp\\n- HumanEval: N=164\\\n368\t    \\ items太少，item parameter估计噪声大 → 6.8pp\\nBaselines比较： - Raw: MAE varies wildly (0.5B\\\n369\t    \\ forgetting场景下raw score反而更接近\\n  true score因为forgetting降低了accuracy)\\n- Remove-and-rescore:\\\n370\t    \\ 有效但改变benchmark composition - Single-signal 2PL+γ: 与full model非常接近(因为RRF≈S1)，MAE差异<0.5pp\\\n371\t    \\ - 这意味着improvement vs best baseline仅0.7pp——4PL(vs 2PL)的c/d参数\\n  提供marginal improvement，formal\\\n372\t    \\ UQ是主要附加值而非point estimate精度\\n\\nDose-response monotonicity违反2次：预期在0.5B(forgetting导致γ方向反转)\\\n373\t    \\ 和3B GSM8K(eval artifact)各出现一次violation。\\nSBC diagnostic p=0.04：rank histogram偏态(不完全uniform)，\\\n374\t    \\ 指向model misspecification而非pure sampling noise。 支持\\\"local independence violation导致coverage\\\n375\t    \\ gap\\\"的解释。\\n\"\n376\t  tables:\n377\t  - name: 'Calibration Results: 4PL+γ vs Baselines (MAE pp, lower is better)'\n378\t    columns:\n379\t    - Method\n380\t    - MMLU\n381\t    - ARC-C\n382\t    - GSM8K\n383\t    - HumanEval\n384\t    - Average\n385\t    - 95% Coverage\n386\t    rows:\n387\t    - - Raw (no adjustment)\n388\t      - 2.1\n389\t      - 1.8\n390\t      - 8.5\n391\t      - 5.2\n392\t      - 4.4\n393\t      - N/A\n394\t    - - Remove-and-rescore\n395\t      - 3.2\n396\t      - 3.5\n397\t      - 6.1\n398\t      - 7.5\n399\t      - 5.1\n400\t      - N/A\n401\t    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ (S1)\n402\t      - 4.0\n403\t      - 4.4\n404\t      - 5.8\n405\t      - 7.2\n406\t      - 4.9\n407\t      - 82%\n408\t    - - Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\n409\t      - 4.5\n410\t      - 4.8\n411\t      - 7.8\n412\t      - 7.0\n413\t      - 6.0\n414\t      - 78%\n415\t    - - Linear regression + bootstrap\n416\t      - 3.5\n417\t      - 3.8\n418\t      - 5.5\n419\t      - 6.5\n420\t      - 4.8\n421\t      - 80%\n422\t    - - Emperor mitigation (rephrase+shuffle)\n423\t      - 2.0\n424\t      - 1.7\n425\t      - 8.2\n426\t      - 5.0\n427\t      - 4.2\n428\t      - N/A\n429\t    - - DCR (EMNLP 2025)\n430\t      - 3.3\n431\t      - 3.6\n432\t      - 5.0\n433\t      - 6.8\n434\t      - 4.7\n435\t      - N/A\n436\t    - - 4PL+γ per-benchmark (ours)\n437\t      - 3.8\n438\t      - 4.1\n439\t      - 5.2\n440\t      - 6.8\n441\t      - 4.2\n442\t      - 85%\n443\t    - - 4PL+γ ME model (ours)\n444\t      - 4.0\n445\t      - 4.3\n446\t      - 5.4\n447\t      - 7.0\n448\t      - 4.4\n449\t      - 87%\n450\t  - name: Per-benchmark γ_k Posterior Summary\n451\t    columns:\n452\t    - Benchmark\n453\t    - γ_mean\n454\t    - γ_sd\n455\t    - CI95_lo\n456\t    - CI95_hi\n457\t    - excludes_zero\n458\t    - interpretation\n459\t    rows:\n460\t    - - MMLU\n461\t      - 0.28\n462\t      - 0.14\n463\t      - -0.01\n464\t      - 0.56\n465\t      - marginal\n466\t      - weak positive effect, CI barely touches 0\n467\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n468\t      - 0.22\n469\t      - 0.16\n470\t      - -0.1\n471\t      - 0.53\n472\t      - 'no'\n473\t      - too noisy to confirm contamination effect\n474\t    - - GSM8K\n475\t      - 0.45\n476\t      - 0.11\n477\t      - 0.23\n478\t      - 0.67\n479\t      - 'yes'\n480\t      - strongest effect, driven by format learning\n481\t    - - HumanEval\n482\t      - 0.35\n483\t      - 0.22\n484\t      - -0.08\n485\t      - 0.78\n486\t      - 'no'\n487\t      - wide CI due to N=164 items\n488\t  - name: Coverage Diagnostic\n489\t    columns:\n490\t    - Nominal\n491\t    - Simple_model\n492\t    - ME_model\n493\t    - SBC_pvalue\n494\t    rows:\n495\t    - - 50%\n496\t      - 42%\n497\t      - 45%\n498\t      - 0.04\n499\t    - - 80%\n500\t      - 72%\n501\t      - 74%\n502\t      - 0.04\n503\t    - - 95%\n504\t      - 82%\n505\t      - 85%\n506\t      - 0.04\n507\t  figures_description:\n508\t  - Calibrated vs True accuracy scatter plot (4 panels = 4 benchmarks)。每个point = 1个model-benchmark\n509\t    pair，x=ground truth clean accuracy, y=calibrated score。灰色对角线=perfect calibration。Error\n510\t    bars = 95% CI。大部分点在对角线附近但scatter明显。0.5B points偏离最大(forgetting)。\n511\t  - 'Dose-response curve: x=dosage(0/5/25/100%), y=accuracy。每benchmark一条线。标注raw score(虚线)和calibrated\n512\t    score(实线)。GSM8K展示最大raw-calibrated gap；MMLU/ARC两条线几乎重合(weak effect)。'\n513\t  - 'Coverage vs nominal level plot: 3条线(simple model, ME model, ideal)。两个model都undercover，ME\n514\t    model略好但gap仍有8-10pp at 95%。'\n515\t  analysis: '核心发现：校准在point estimate上与DCR和linear regression基线持平 (MAE improvement仅0.5-0.7pp)，不足以支撑\"significant\n516\t    calibration improvement\" claim。但4PL+γ的unique value在于： (1) 提供formal Bayesian CIs(其他方法无此功能或仅有bootstrap\n517\t    CI)； (2) 通过γ_k量化per-benchmark contamination susceptibility； (3) 理论框架可扩展(更好信号→更窄CI)。\n518\t    论文策略：calibration claim降级为proof-of-concept，在GSM8K(强效应)上 展示有效性，MMLU/ARC上报告CI重叠并诚实讨论power不足。\n519\t    强调：单信号2PL+γ与4PL+γ差异<0.5pp MAE → 4PL的c/d参数marginal， 但对MC item的realistic modeling仍是preferred(reviewer\n520\t    concern #5)。 ME model不作为primary(仅提升2.5pp coverage)，simple model为主， ME为ablation——符合D025/D8定位。\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t- name: scale_bridging_7b\n524\t  plan_id: exp-007\n525\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosage levels(0/5/25/50/100%)。\n526\t    验证校准精度扩展到更大模型。需multi-GPU(7B LoRA SFT ~4-8h/run on 1×H100)。\n527\t\n528\t    '\n529\t  expected_results:\n530\t    n_sft_runs: 10\n531\t    d000_mmlu: 0.742\n532\t    d000_gsm8k: 0.792\n533\t    d000_arc: 0.875\n534\t    d000_humaneval: 0.45\n535\t    d005_mmlu: 0.748\n536\t    d005_gsm8k: 0.795\n537\t    d005_arc: 0.878\n538\t    d100_mmlu: 0.768\n539\t    d100_gsm8k: 0.815\n540\t    d100_arc: 0.892\n541\t    d100_humaneval: 0.52\n542\t    contamination_inflation_mmlu_d100_pp: 2.6\n543\t    contamination_inflation_gsm8k_d100_pp: 2.3\n544\t    contamination_inflation_arc_d100_pp: 1.7\n545\t    contamination_inflation_humaneval_d100_pp: 7.0\n546\t    no_catastrophic_forgetting: true\n547\t    S1_auc_d005: 0.972\n548\t    S2_auc_d005: 0.58\n549\t    S4_auc_d005: 0.55\n550\t    gamma_7b_mmlu_mean: 0.32\n551\t    gamma_7b_mmlu_ci_excludes_zero: true\n552\t    mae_calibrated_pp: 3.4\n553\t    ci_coverage_95pct: 84\n554\t    gpu_hours_actual: 28\n555\t  result_rationale: '7B模型有足够capacity同时学习SFT task和memorize benchmark items而不发生 catastrophic\n556\t    forgetting(0.5B forgetting源于model capacity不足以容纳 new SFT knowledge + benchmark\n557\t    memorization)。因此dose-response curve 应为单调递增(contamination → inflation)，而非0.5B的先降后稳pattern。\n558\t\n559\t    Contamination inflation at 7B: 基于1.5B/3B观察的趋势外推—— 1.5B MMLU inflation +1.7pp,\n560\t    3B +0.8pp(weak)。7B在MMLU/ARC上 inflation可能稍大(2-3pp)因为更大model对memorized items的recall更强，\n561\t    但仍属于\"weak inflation\"范畴(benchmark本身的MC format限制了inflation ceiling——random items的memorization对4选1\n562\t    accuracy的边际贡献有限)。 HumanEval inflation更大(~7pp)因为code generation是open-ended task，\n563\t    memorized solution直接提升pass@1。\n564\t\n565\t    Signal behavior at 7B: S1仍然dominant(embedding-based, model-agnostic)。 S2(Min-K++)可能改善到AUC\n566\t    0.58——7B的logit distribution更informative， 但SFT后的distribution shift仍然是fundamental\n567\t    challenge。 不足以改变\"single effective signal\"结论。\n568\t\n569\t    校准在7B上应比0.5B更好(无forgetting confound, 更清晰的dose-response)， MAE ~3.4pp。但CI coverage仍然undercover(84%)因为local\n570\t    independence violation与model scale无关(是IRT在LLM evaluation场景的structural limitation)。\n571\t\n572\t    GPU budget 28h(比planned 30h略少)：7B LoRA SFT比full fine-tune高效， 但eval需要更多memory。\n573\t\n574\t    '\n575\t  tables:\n576\t  - name: 7B Dose-Response (accuracy, seed-averaged)\n577\t    columns:\n578\t    - Dosage\n579\t    - MMLU\n580\t    - GSM8K\n581\t    - ARC-C\n582\t    - HumanEval\n583\t    rows:\n584\t    - - d000 (clean)\n585\t      - 0.742\n586\t      - 0.792\n587\t      - 0.875\n588\t      - 0.45\n589\t    - - d005 (5%)\n590\t      - 0.748\n591\t      - 0.795\n592\t      - 0.878\n593\t      - 0.465\n594\t    - - d025 (25%)\n595\t      - 0.755\n596\t      - 0.8\n597\t      - 0.882\n598\t      - 0.48\n599\t    - - d050 (50%)\n600\t      - 0.76\n601\t      - 0.808\n602\t      - 0.887\n603\t      - 0.5\n604\t    - - d100 (100%)\n605\t      - 0.768\n606\t      - 0.815\n607\t      - 0.892\n608\t      - 0.52\n609\t  - name: '7B vs Smaller Scales: Contamination Inflation (d100-d000, pp)'\n610\t    columns:\n611\t    - Scale\n612\t    - MMLU\n613\t    - GSM8K\n614\t    - ARC-C\n615\t    - HumanEval\n616\t    rows:\n617\t    - - 0.5B\n618\t      - -16.5\n619\t      - -0.4\n620\t      - -17.5\n621\t      - -11.0\n622\t    - - 1.5B\n623\t      - 1.7\n624\t      - 1.5\n625\t      - -0.3\n626\t      - 17.7\n627\t    - - 3B\n628\t      - 0.8\n629\t      - 57.7*\n630\t      - 1.2\n631\t      - 0.6\n632\t    - - 7B\n633\t      - 2.6\n634\t      - 2.3\n635\t      - 1.7\n636\t      - 7.0\n637\t  figures_description:\n638\t  - 4-panel dose-response curve, 每panel一个benchmark。4条线=4个scale(0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B)。0.5B明显下降(forgetting),\n639\t    1.5B/3B/7B轻微上升(inflation)。GSM8K 3B数据标记为artifact(星号)。7B线最平滑、最monotonic。\n640\t  analysis: '7B验证了contamination inflation是real但weak的pattern(MMLU/ARC <3pp)。 没有catastrophic\n641\t    forgetting消除了0.5B数据的confound。 但inflation magnitude仍然小——这对论文是双刃剑： (a)好消息：contamination对大模型benchmark\n642\t    score影响有限→实际风险可控； (b)坏消息：weak effect下calibration improvement很小→hard to show statistical\n643\t    significance。 7B数据最有价值的用途是加入pooled N_models(增加到34-38)， 改善identifiability和CI precision。\n644\t\n645\t    '\n646\t- name: signal_survival_analysis\n647\t  plan_id: exp-008\n648\t  description: '系统评估检测信号在不同scale/dosage下的可靠性。0.5B数据已有(v4)， 需扩展到1.5B/3B controlled\n649\t    models + Instruct/RL proxy models。\n650\t\n651\t    '\n652\t  expected_results:\n653\t    S1_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.968\n654\t    S1_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.961\n655\t    S2_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.503\n656\t    S2_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.538\n657\t    S4_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.505\n658\t    S4_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.523\n659\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: -2.11\n660\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: -2.24\n661\t    S2_reversal_universal: true\n662\t    S4_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: 0.53\n663\t    S4_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: 0.6\n664\t    effective_signals_15B: 1\n665\t    effective_signals_3B: 1\n666\t    instruct_proxy_S1_auc_15B: 0.62\n667\t    instruct_proxy_S2_auc_15B: 0.48\n668\t    instruct_proxy_S4_auc_15B: 0.51\n669\t    instruct_signal_degradation_vs_sft: true\n670\t    s2_s4_auc_at_3B_avg: 0.531\n671\t  result_rationale: '0.5B数据(已完成)确立了基线：S1 AUC 0.979, S2 0.465, S4 0.481。 Median tier核心假设是S2/S4在1.5B/3B不恢复。\n672\t\n673\t    S2(Min-K++)在1.5B/3B的表现：Min-K++计算token log-probability的k-th percentile，假设memorized\n674\t    text的low-probability tokens概率升高。 SFT contamination不同于pretraining data leakage——SFT主要改变response\n675\t    distribution而非input distribution。对于MC benchmark items，model看到 的是question+options，SFT可能memorize了answer\n676\t    pattern但不改变 question tokens的probability。因此Min-K++在question tokens上 无法区分contaminated/clean，AUC接近chance。\n677\t    1.5B/3B的improvement(0.50→0.54)来自更大model对answer tokens的 memorization effect微弱反映在logit中。\n678\t\n679\t    S2 directional reversal在1.5B/3B持续：d100时全部items都contaminated， model整体logit distribution右移(所有items概率升高)，Min-K++的\n680\t    percentile ranking反而将contaminated items排在\"less anomalous\"一端。 Cohen''s d保持负值且magnitude与0.5B\n681\t    comparable(-2.0~-2.3)。\n682\t\n683\t    S4(Self-Critique)需要model产生\"I''ve seen this before\"的meta-cognitive signal。SFT后的1.5B/3B可能在entropy上有微小差异(contaminated\n684\t    items entropy略低)但effect size不足以达到useful AUC。\n685\t\n686\t    Instruct模型(RL proxy)：RL post-training进一步重塑logit distribution， S1(embedding-based)仅检测training\n687\t    data是否包含benchmark items—— Instruct模型的SFT数据可能包含benchmark-related content(来自instruction\n688\t    tuning data sourcing)，但与controlled contamination不同。 S1 AUC降到0.62反映的是\"natural exposure\"而非\"zero\n689\t    signal\"。\n690\t\n691\t    Signal × regime heatmap将展示清晰的pattern：S1在SFT regime有效， 在RL regime降级；S2/S4在所有regime无效。这是C2的core\n692\t    figure。\n693\t\n694\t    '\n695\t  tables:\n696\t  - name: Signal × Scale AUC Heatmap (d005, within-model)\n697\t    columns:\n698\t    - Signal\n699\t    - 0.5B_SFT\n700\t    - 1.5B_SFT\n701\t    - 3B_SFT\n702\t    - 1.5B_Instruct\n703\t    - 3B_Instruct\n704\t    rows:\n705\t    - - S1_Embedding\n706\t      - 0.979\n707\t      - 0.968\n708\t      - 0.961\n709\t      - 0.62\n710\t      - 0.58\n711\t    - - S2_MinKPP\n712\t      - 0.465\n713\t      - 0.503\n714\t      - 0.538\n715\t      - 0.48\n716\t      - 0.5\n717\t    - - S4_SelfCritique\n718\t      - 0.481\n719\t      - 0.505\n720\t      - 0.523\n721\t      - 0.51\n722\t      - 0.52\n723\t  - name: Cross-model Cohen's d at d100 (all benchmarks averaged)\n724\t    columns:\n725\t    - Signal\n726\t    - 0.5B\n727\t    - 1.5B\n728\t    - 3B\n729\t    rows:\n730\t    - - S1_Embedding\n731\t      - 3.6\n732\t      - 3.37\n733\t      - 3.24\n734\t    - - S2_MinKPP\n735\t      - -1.98\n736\t      - -2.11\n737\t      - -2.24\n738\t    - - S4_SelfCritique\n739\t      - 0.45\n740\t      - 0.53\n741\t      - 0.6\n742\t  figures_description:\n743\t  - Signal × scale × regime AUC heatmap (Figure 2 of paper)。行=3 signals, 列=scale×regime组合。颜色从深蓝(AUC≤0.5)到深红(AUC≥0.95)。S1行在SFT列全红，Instruct列浅橙。S2/S4行全蓝。一目了然的failure\n744\t    mode map。\n745\t  - 'Min-K++ reversal plot: 3 panels (0.5B/1.5B/3B)，每panel展示d000 vs d100的S2 score\n746\t    distribution (violin plot)。d100 distribution系统性低于d000，标注Cohen''s d。所有3个scale方向一致。'\n747\t  analysis: 'S2/S4在所有controlled scales上的持续失败是median tier最清晰的结果。 C2 claim确认为\"method-specific\n748\t    signal effectiveness\"而非\"scale-dependent\"。 Min-K++ reversal在3个scale上的consistency(Cohen''s\n749\t    d均在-1.2~-2.9) 使其成为robust empirical finding，适合作为cautionary result发表。 Instruct proxy数据提供directional\n750\t    evidence但不构成formal RL claim。\n751\t\n752\t    '\n753\t- name: multi_family_validation\n754\t  plan_id: exp-014\n755\t  description: '在Llama-3.2-1B(或Pythia-1.4B)上进行controlled SFT injection at 3 dosage\n756\t    levels(0/25/100%)。验证identifiability boundaries和calibration accuracy跨model family的generalizability。\n757\t\n758\t    '\n759\t  expected_results:\n760\t    model: Llama-3.2-1B\n761\t    dosages:\n762\t    - 0\n763\t    - 25\n764\t    - 100\n765\t    seeds: 2\n766\t    n_runs: 6\n767\t    d000_mmlu: 0.328\n768\t    d000_arc: 0.415\n769\t    d000_gsm8k: 0.215\n770\t    d025_mmlu: 0.31\n771\t    d025_arc: 0.395\n772\t    d100_mmlu: 0.285\n773\t    d100_arc: 0.362\n774\t    catastrophic_forgetting_observed: true\n775\t    forgetting_severity_vs_qwen05B: comparable\n776\t    S1_auc_d005_proxy: 0.965\n777\t    S2_auc_d005: 0.47\n778\t    gamma_llama_mmlu_mean: 0.18\n779\t    gamma_llama_mmlu_ci_excludes_zero: false\n780\t    mae_calibrated_pp: 5.8\n781\t    mae_vs_qwen_same_scale_delta_pp: 1.8\n782\t    cross_family_gamma_correlation_r: 0.72\n783\t    gpu_hours_actual: 12\n784\t  result_rationale: 'Llama-3.2-1B与Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B capacity comparable但architecture不同\n785\t    (Llama用GQA, Qwen用standard MHA at small scales)。在1B scale上， 模型capacity有限，SFT contamination可能同样引发catastrophic\n786\t    forgetting (MMLU/ARC下降而非上升)——与Qwen2.5-0.5B pattern一致。\n787\t\n788\t    S1(embedding)是model-agnostic的，paraphrase embeddings与original items的相似度不依赖target\n789\t    model → AUC应与Qwen一致(~0.96)。 S2(Min-K++)在Llama logit distribution上同样无效(原因相同：SFT\n790\t    改变response distribution而非input token probability)。\n791\t\n792\t    γ estimate在Llama上更noisy：(1)仅3个dosage levels(vs Qwen的4个)→ dose-response curve fitting不够precise；(2)仅2\n793\t    seeds→更大variance； (3)forgetting confound与Qwen 0.5B相同。CI不排除0。\n794\t\n795\t    Cross-family γ correlation r=0.72：per-benchmark γ_k的相对ranking 在两个family间方向一致(GSM8K\n796\t    > MMLU > ARC)但absolute magnitude不同。 这支持\"contamination susceptibility是benchmark\n797\t    property\"的claim 但precision不足以做formal statistical claim。\n798\t\n799\t    MAE 5.8pp(vs Qwen avg 4.2pp)：差距来自(1)fewer data points导致 IRT item parameters估计更差,\n800\t    (2)Llama tokenizer不同→eval format alignment可能有subtle issues, (3)单独fitting Llama数据的N_models=6太少。\n801\t\n802\t    这个实验的定位是rebuttal-ready——不入主submission。如果reviewer要求 multi-family evidence，r=0.72的directional\n803\t    consistency足够。\n804\t\n805\t    '\n806\t  tables:\n807\t  - name: Llama-3.2-1B Dose-Response\n808\t    columns:\n809\t    - Dosage\n810\t    - MMLU\n811\t    - ARC-C\n812\t    - GSM8K\n813\t    rows:\n814\t    - - d000 (clean)\n815\t      - 0.328\n816\t      - 0.415\n817\t      - 0.215\n818\t    - - d025 (25%)\n819\t      - 0.31\n820\t      - 0.395\n821\t      - 0.22\n822\t    - - d100 (100%)\n823\t      - 0.285\n824\t      - 0.362\n825\t      - 0.218\n826\t  - name: Cross-family γ_k Comparison\n827\t    columns:\n828\t    - Benchmark\n829\t    - γ_Qwen\n830\t    - γ_Llama\n831\t    - direction_consistent\n832\t    rows:\n833\t    - - MMLU\n834\t      - 0.28\n835\t      - 0.18\n836\t      - 'yes'\n837\t    - - ARC-C\n838\t      - 0.22\n839\t      - 0.12\n840\t      - 'yes'\n841\t    - - GSM8K\n842\t      - 0.45\n843\t      - 0.35\n844\t      - 'yes'\n845\t    - - Correlation r\n846\t      - —\n847\t      - —\n848\t      - 0.72\n849\t  figures_description:\n850\t  - 'Cross-family scatter: x=γ_Qwen, y=γ_Llama, 每个点=一个benchmark。对角线=perfect agreement。点在对角线下方(Llama\n851\t    γ consistently lower)但ranking preserved。标注r=0.72。'\n852\t  analysis: 'Llama验证了方向一致性但quantitative gap明显(MAE差1.8pp)。 Forgetting pattern在小模型上是universal(不是Qwen-specific)。\n853\t    作为rebuttal material足够——\"single family\"限制可以用directional consistency回应。但不能claim\"method\n854\t    generalizes across families\"。\n855\t\n856\t    '\n857\t- name: rl_observational_case_study\n858\t  plan_id: exp-009\n859\t  description: '将Self-Critique + available signals应用于existing RL-trained models: Qwen2.5-Instruct(0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B),\n860\t    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B/7B。 拟合IRT with wider CIs。Expected regret quantification。\n861\t\n862\t    '\n863\t  expected_results:\n864\t    n_rl_models: 8\n865\t    signals_available:\n866\t    - S1_Embedding\n867\t    - S4_SelfCritique\n868\t    S1_auc_on_rl_models: 0.58\n869\t    S4_auc_on_rl_models: 0.52\n870\t    effective_auc_for_irt: 0.56\n871\t    gamma_rl_posterior_mean: 0.15\n872\t    gamma_rl_posterior_sd: 0.25\n873\t    gamma_rl_ci95:\n874\t    - -0.35\n875\t    - 0.65\n876\t    gamma_rl_ci_excludes_zero: false\n877\t    ci_width_mean_pp: 14.2\n878\t    ci_width_range_pp:\n879\t    - 10.5\n880\t    - 18.0\n881\t    expected_regret_uncalibrated_top5: 0.42\n882\t    expected_regret_calibrated_top5: 0.28\n883\t    expected_regret_reduction_pct: 33\n884\t    near_zero_gamma_on_clean_benchmark: true\n885\t    near_zero_gamma_clean_value: 0.03\n886\t    specificity_check_pass: true\n887\t    gpu_hours_actual: 12\n888\t  result_rationale: 'RL models的关键挑战：S1(embedding retrieval)检测的是训练数据中是否 包含benchmark\n889\t    items。RL models(Instruct variants)的SFT阶段可能 inadvertently包含benchmark-adjacent data，但不是controlled\n890\t    injection。 S1 AUC ~0.58反映的是\"natural exposure\"的base rate——一些benchmark items确实出现在instruction\n891\t    tuning corpus中，但exposure level远低于 controlled d005/d025/d100。\n892\t\n893\t    S2(Min-K++)在RL models上更无效：RL post-training(RLHF/DPO) fundamentally reshapes logit\n894\t    distribution，Min-K++的pretraining distribution assumption完全失效。排除S2。\n895\t\n896\t    S4(Self-Critique)在Instruct models上marginally better(0.52)： instruction-tuned models有一定的meta-cognitive能力，但不足以\n897\t    reliably detect contamination。\n898\t\n899\t    Effective AUC 0.56(S1+S4 RRF)处于Fisher Info analysis的 structural identifiability\n900\t    threshold(AUC≥0.55)但远低于practical threshold(AUC≥0.70)。结果：γ posterior极宽(CI [-0.35,\n901\t    0.65])， 不排除0，校准本质上是\"不知道是否有contamination\"。\n902\t\n903\t    Wide CIs(14.2pp avg)是honest uncertainty quantification—— 当信号质量不足时，模型正确地表达\"我不确定\"。这实际上是C3\n904\t    (identifiability claim)的最佳illustration：Fisher Info理论 预测low-AUC regime下CI宽度↑，RL\n905\t    case study实证验证了这一点。\n906\t\n907\t    Expected regret reduction 33%看似modest但来自两个来源： (1) wide CIs使calibrated ranking\n908\t    less confident → top-5选择 更conservative → 减少overconfident wrong choices； (2) near-zero\n909\t    γ on clean benchmark confirms specificity—— model不在没有contamination的地方hallucinate\n910\t    contamination。\n911\t\n912\t    Near-zero γ specificity check：在未被contaminate的benchmark上 (如MMLU sub-categories\n913\t    known to be clean)，γ ≈ 0.03 ± 0.20， CI宽泛地包含0。模型不会false-positive。\n914\t\n915\t    '\n916\t  tables:\n917\t  - name: RL Observational Results\n918\t    columns:\n919\t    - Model\n920\t    - MMLU_raw\n921\t    - MMLU_calibrated\n922\t    - CI_width_pp\n923\t    - gamma_contribution_pp\n924\t    rows:\n925\t    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n926\t      - 0.435\n927\t      - 0.428\n928\t      - 15.2\n929\t      - -0.7\n930\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n931\t      - 0.605\n932\t      - 0.598\n933\t      - 13.8\n934\t      - -0.7\n935\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n936\t      - 0.655\n937\t      - 0.648\n938\t      - 12.5\n939\t      - -0.7\n940\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n941\t      - 0.752\n942\t      - 0.745\n943\t      - 11.2\n944\t      - -0.7\n945\t    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n946\t      - 0.548\n947\t      - 0.54\n948\t      - 16.5\n949\t      - -0.8\n950\t    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n951\t      - 0.718\n952\t      - 0.71\n953\t      - 13.0\n954\t      - -0.8\n955\t  - name: Expected Regret (Top-5 Selection)\n956\t    columns:\n957\t    - Strategy\n958\t    - Regret\n959\t    - vs_Uncalibrated\n960\t    rows:\n961\t    - - Uncalibrated (raw scores)\n962\t      - 0.42\n963\t      - —\n964\t    - - Calibrated (4PL+γ)\n965\t      - 0.28\n966\t      - -33%\n967\t    - - Remove-and-rescore\n968\t      - 0.35\n969\t      - -17%\n970\t  figures_description:\n971\t  - 'CI width vs effective signal AUC scatter: 每个点=一个model，x=该model的effective signal\n972\t    AUC，y=calibrated CI width。清晰的负相关：AUC↑→CI↓。Controlled SFT models(AUC~0.97)在左下角(窄CI)，RL\n973\t    models(AUC~0.56)在右上角(宽CI)。Fisher Info theoretical curve overlay。'\n974\t  analysis: 'RL case study的核心价值不是calibration accuracy(γ估计太noisy)， 而是(1) C3 identifiability\n975\t    claim的empirical validation—— theory predicts wide CIs at low AUC, data confirms；\n976\t    (2) specificity check——γ≈0 on clean benchmarks； (3) honest framing of what calibration\n977\t    CAN''T do when signals are weak。 这是\"signal characterization + identifiability\n978\t    boundaries\"叙事的 关键evidence，而非\"calibration works everywhere\"的evidence。\n979\t\n980\t    '\n981\t- name: observational_72b\n982\t  plan_id: exp-012\n983\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only, no SFT)。 扩展ecological\n984\t    validity到frontier model scale。\n985\t\n986\t    '\n987\t  expected_results:\n988\t    mmlu_raw: 0.852\n989\t    gsm8k_raw: 0.915\n990\t    arc_raw: 0.945\n991\t    humaneval_raw: 0.725\n992\t    S1_exposure_mean: 0.35\n993\t    S1_exposure_std: 0.28\n994\t    gamma_72b_posterior_mean: 0.08\n995\t    gamma_72b_ci95:\n996\t    - -0.15\n997\t    - 0.31\n998\t    gamma_72b_excludes_zero: false\n999\t    calibrated_mmlu: 0.845\n1000\t    calibrated_gsm8k: 0.91\n1001\t    calibrated_arc: 0.94\n1002\t    ci_width_pp: 8.5\n1003\t    gpu_hours_actual: 12\n1004\t  result_rationale: '72B是inference-only——没有ground truth clean score，无法计算MAE。 只能报告directional\n1005\t    results：calibrated score是否低于raw score (suggesting contamination)，CI width是否reasonable。\n1006\t\n1007\t    S1 exposure scores for 72B基于embedding retrieval against known training data proxies(Common\n1008\t    Crawl, Wikipedia, etc.)。72B的训练数据 更大更diverse，expected exposure level higher(mean\n1009\t    0.35)但这是 \"natural co-occurrence\"而非controlled contamination。\n1010\t\n1011\t    γ估计在observational setting下更难——没有dose-response variation (单个model, single exposure\n1012\t    level)。如果72B被加入pooled IRT fitting (与controlled models一起)，它贡献一个data point，γ posterior\n1013\t    受其他models的dose-response pattern inform。但72B的exposure 不是experimentally controlled\n1014\t    → extrapolation risk。\n1015\t\n1016\t    Calibrated score比raw低约0.5-1.0pp(small correction)， CI width ~8.5pp(比RL models窄因为S1\n1017\t    signal quality better for a well-known model)。但CI不排除0 → 无法conclude contamination。\n1018\t\n1019\t    主要价值：展示framework可以apply到frontier-scale model， 且不会给出荒谬结果(calibration correction\n1020\t    small and reasonable)。\n1021\t\n1022\t    '\n1023\t  tables:\n1024\t  - name: 72B Observational Results\n1025\t    columns:\n1026\t    - Benchmark\n1027\t    - Raw\n1028\t    - Calibrated\n1029\t    - Delta\n1030\t    - CI_width_pp\n1031\t    rows:\n1032\t    - - MMLU\n1033\t      - 0.852\n1034\t      - 0.845\n1035\t      - -0.7\n1036\t      - 8.2\n1037\t    - - GSM8K\n1038\t      - 0.915\n1039\t      - 0.91\n1040\t      - -0.5\n1041\t      - 7.8\n1042\t    - - ARC-C\n1043\t      - 0.945\n1044\t      - 0.94\n1045\t      - -0.5\n1046\t      - 8.0\n1047\t    - - HumanEval\n1048\t      - 0.725\n1049\t      - 0.718\n1050\t      - -0.7\n1051\t      - 10.0\n1052\t  figures_description:\n1053\t  - 72B results作为scatter plot的一个extra point，与controlled models一起展示。72B在高accuracy区域(右上角)，CI\n1054\t    bar可视化。\n1055\t  analysis: '72B observational是ecological validity argument——框架在frontier scale上产出sensible\n1056\t    results。不提供quantitative validation(无ground truth)。 置于appendix或supplementary material。\n1057\t\n1058\t    '\n1059\t- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n1060\t  plan_id: exp-013\n1061\t  description: 'Degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique, 无logits/embeddings)\n1062\t    for closed-weight models。消融量化2-signal vs 4-signal calibration accuracy gap。\n1063\t\n1064\t    '\n1065\t  expected_results:\n1066\t    composite_2signal_auc_d005: 0.568\n1067\t    composite_2signal_auc_d025: 0.55\n1068\t    gamma_2signal_mean: 0.15\n1069\t    gamma_2signal_sd: 0.28\n1070\t    gamma_2signal_ci_excludes_zero: false\n1071\t    mae_calibrated_2signal_pp: 7.2\n1072\t    mae_vs_4signal_gap_pp: 3.0\n1073\t    ci_coverage_95pct: 78\n1074\t    ci_width_pp: 16.5\n1075\t    kendall_tau: 0.65\n1076\t    calibration_useful: false\n1077\t  result_rationale: '2-signal mode仅使用ConStat(performance gap)和Self-Critique(entropy)。\n1078\t    在median tier下，ConStat AUC ~0.61-0.64 at 1.5B/3B，Self-Critique ~0.50-0.52。RRF composite\n1079\t    ~0.57——处于structural identifiability threshold(AUC≥0.55)但远低于practical threshold(AUC≥0.70)。\n1080\t\n1081\t    Fisher Info at AUC=0.57: I(γ) ≈ 3400 (from fisher_info_verification.json 的AUC\n1082\t    sweep interpolation)。但这是conditional on known item parameters。 Marginal posterior会更宽——exp-004\n1083\t    simulation在AUC=0.55/N=20时 CI width=13.3pp，在N=26 with AUC=0.57 → CI width ~15-17pp。\n1084\t\n1085\t    γ posterior wide enough to include 0 → calibration无法有效区分 contaminated和clean scores。MAE\n1086\t    7.2pp(vs 4-signal 4.2pp)—— degradation 3.0pp。CI coverage drops to 78%(CIs too\n1087\t    narrow relative to actual error因为point estimate更biased)。\n1088\t\n1089\t    Kendall tau 0.65(vs 4-signal 0.80)：ranking preservation差因为 noisy exposure scores导致错误的contamination\n1090\t    attribution。\n1091\t\n1092\t    结论：closed-weight mode在当前信号条件下不可用(not useful)。 这是honest limitation——论文报告为\"closed-weight\n1093\t    applicability requires stronger signals than currently available\"。\n1094\t\n1095\t    '\n1096\t  tables:\n1097\t  - name: 2-signal vs 4-signal Calibration Comparison\n1098\t    columns:\n1099\t    - Metric\n1100\t    - 4-signal\n1101\t    - 2-signal\n1102\t    - Delta\n1103\t    rows:\n1104\t    - - Composite AUC (d005)\n1105\t      - 0.979\n1106\t      - 0.568\n1107\t      - -0.411\n1108\t    - - MAE (pp)\n1109\t      - 4.2\n1110\t      - 7.2\n1111\t      - 3.0\n1112\t    - - 95% Coverage\n1113\t      - 85%\n1114\t      - 78%\n1115\t      - -7%\n1116\t    - - CI Width (pp)\n1117\t      - 11.3\n1118\t      - 16.5\n1119\t      - 5.2\n1120\t    - - Kendall τ\n1121\t      - 0.8\n1122\t      - 0.65\n1123\t      - -0.15\n1124\t    - - γ CI excludes 0 rate\n1125\t      - 62.5%\n1126\t      - 12.5%\n1127\t      - -50%\n1128\t  figures_description:\n1129\t  - 'Paired bar chart: 4-signal vs 2-signal在每个metric上的对比。所有指标4-signal显著优于2-signal。'\n1130\t  analysis: '2-signal mode的失败直接map到Fisher Info identifiability framework： AUC 0.57\n1131\t    < practical threshold 0.70 → calibration unreliable。 这是C3(identifiability)的validation\n1132\t    case——理论预测在此AUC regime下 calibration ineffective，实验证实。论文处理：report as P2 ablation\n1133\t    in appendix，引用Fisher Info analysis解释为何不work。 Frame as \"future work: when better\n1134\t    closed-weight signals become available (e.g., improved ConStat variants), the\n1135\t    framework is ready.\"\n1136\t\n1137\t    '\n1138\t- name: simulation_identifiability_sweep\n1139\t  plan_id: exp-004\n1140\t  description: '144-condition synthetic-data sweep(已完成48/120 runs)的full completion\n1141\t    预测。AUC(0.55-0.90) × N_models(20-200) × prior × exposure_type。 包含SBC diagnostic和Fisher\n1142\t    Info matrix analysis。\n1143\t\n1144\t    '\n1145\t  expected_results:\n1146\t    total_conditions: 120\n1147\t    total_runs_with_seeds: 1200\n1148\t    gamma_rmse_auc080_n50: 0.032\n1149\t    gamma_rmse_auc055_n20: 0.068\n1150\t    gamma_rmse_auc065_n50: 0.048\n1151\t    gamma_rmse_auc090_n100: 0.018\n1152\t    ci_width_auc080_n50_pp: 12.8\n1153\t    ci_width_auc055_n20_pp: 13.3\n1154\t    ci_width_auc065_n50_pp: 10.2\n1155\t    ci_width_auc090_n100_pp: 7.5\n1156\t    ci_coverage_n20_pct: 84\n1157\t    ci_coverage_n50_pct: 92\n1158\t    ci_coverage_n100_pct: 96\n1159\t    structural_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.55\n1160\t    practical_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.7\n1161\t    sqrt_n_scaling_confirmed: true\n1162\t    sqrt_n_scaling_deviation_pct: 4\n1163\t    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue_n20: 0.03\n1164\t    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue_n50: 0.08\n1165\t    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue_n100: 0.35\n1166\t    growing_pains_preestimation_benefit_pp: 1.2\n1167\t    fisher_info_theory_empirical_ratio: 0.998\n1168\t    prior_sensitivity_gamma_shift_max: 0.04\n1169\t    cpu_hours_total: 800\n1170\t  result_rationale: \"已完成的48 runs (AUC 0.55/0.80 × N 20/50/100)确立了core findings： -\\\n1171\t    \\ γ bias ≤ 0.02, RMSE ≤ 0.04 at AUC=0.80 - 1/√N scaling within 4% - 100% power\\\n1172\t    \\ (all runs detect γ≠0) - CI width inflation ratio 1.81-1.95× at AUC 0.80 vs 0.55\\n\\\n1173\t    剩余72 runs (AUC 0.65/0.90)将填充中间和高端： - AUC 0.65: 介于0.55和0.80之间。RMSE ~0.048 at N=50(插值)。\\n\\\n1174\t    \\  这个AUC regime对应\\\"marginal signal quality\\\"——S3(ConStat)\\n  在1.5B/3B的实测AUC。CI\\\n1175\t    \\ width ~10pp at N=50。\\n  Coverage: ~88% at N=50(低于nominal但好于N=20的84%)。\\n- AUC\\\n1176\t    \\ 0.90: near-perfect signal。RMSE <0.02 at N=100。\\n  CI width ~7.5pp。Coverage approaches\\\n1177\t    \\ 95%+ at N≥50。\\n  但这个regime在现实中只有S1 embedding达到(AUC~0.97)。\\n\\nSBC diagnostic:\\\n1178\t    \\ N=20时rank histogram偏态(p=0.03)指向underdispersion—— posterior too narrow relative\\\n1179\t    \\ to prior predictive。这is consistent with the real-data coverage gap (85% vs 95%)。N≥50时SBC\\\n1180\t    \\ passes (p>0.05)。 说明coverage gap partly from insufficient N_models。\\nFisher Info\\\n1181\t    \\ theory-empirical ratio 0.998(从fisher_info_verification.json 已确认)。The theoretical\\\n1182\t    \\ framework is validated。\\nGrowing Pains pre-estimation: at N=20, using pre-estimated\\\n1183\t    \\ item parameters (from larger dataset) reduces CI width by ~1.2pp。 Marginal benefit\\\n1184\t    \\ — not enough to close the coverage gap alone。\\n\"\n1185\t  tables:\n1186\t  - name: Identifiability Phase Diagram (γ RMSE)\n1187\t    columns:\n1188\t    - AUC\\N_models\n1189\t    - '20'\n1190\t    - '50'\n1191\t    - '100'\n1192\t    - '200'\n1193\t    rows:\n1194\t    - - '0.55'\n1195\t      - 0.068\n1196\t      - 0.042\n1197\t      - 0.03\n1198\t      - 0.021\n1199\t    - - '0.65'\n1200\t      - 0.055\n1201\t      - 0.035\n1202\t      - 0.025\n1203\t      - 0.018\n1204\t    - - '0.80'\n1205\t      - 0.045\n1206\t      - 0.032\n1207\t      - 0.022\n1208\t      - 0.015\n1209\t    - - '0.90'\n1210\t      - 0.038\n1211\t      - 0.025\n1212\t      - 0.018\n1213\t      - 0.012\n1214\t  - name: 95% CI Width (pp)\n1215\t    columns:\n1216\t    - AUC\\N_models\n1217\t    - '20'\n1218\t    - '50'\n1219\t    - '100'\n1220\t    - '200'\n1221\t    rows:\n1222\t    - - '0.55'\n1223\t      - 13.3\n1224\t      - 8.9\n1225\t      - 6.5\n1226\t      - 4.6\n1227\t    - - '0.65'\n1228\t      - 11.5\n1229\t      - 7.8\n1230\t      - 5.6\n1231\t      - 4.0\n1232\t    - - '0.80'\n1233\t      - 14.2\n1234\t      - 9.8\n1235\t      - 7.2\n1236\t      - 5.1\n1237\t    - - '0.90'\n1238\t      - 12.8\n1239\t      - 8.5\n1240\t      - 6.2\n1241\t      - 4.4\n1242\t  - name: CI Coverage at 95% Nominal\n1243\t    columns:\n1244\t    - AUC\\N_models\n1245\t    - '20'\n1246\t    - '50'\n1247\t    - '100'\n1248\t    - '200'\n1249\t    rows:\n1250\t    - - '0.55'\n1251\t      - 82%\n1252\t      - 90%\n1253\t      - 95%\n1254\t      - 96%\n1255\t    - - '0.65'\n1256\t      - 84%\n1257\t      - 91%\n1258\t      - 95%\n1259\t      - 96%\n1260\t    - - '0.80'\n1261\t      - 86%\n1262\t      - 93%\n1263\t      - 96%\n1264\t      - 97%\n1265\t    - - '0.90'\n1266\t      - 88%\n1267\t      - 94%\n1268\t      - 97%\n1269\t      - 98%\n1270\t  figures_description:\n1271\t  - 'Identifiability phase diagram (Figure 4 of paper): x=AUC, y=N_models, color=γ\n1272\t    RMSE。等高线标注structural(RMSE<0.10)和practical(RMSE<0.04)边界。当前实验条件(AUC~0.97, N~26)用star标注，落在practical\n1273\t    threshold内但边缘。'\n1274\t  - '1/√N scaling plot: log(N) vs log(CI_width)，4条线对应4个AUC水平。斜率均接近-0.5(理论值)。'\n1275\t  analysis: \"Simulation sweep提供C3(identifiability)的full empirical backing。 Key paper-ready\\\n1276\t    \\ claims: (1) Structural identifiability at AUC≥0.55(γ always recoverable in principle)\\\n1277\t    \\ (2) Practical identifiability at AUC≥0.70 and N≥50(RMSE<0.04, coverage>90%)\\\n1278\t    \\ (3) Current experimental condition (AUC~0.97 S1, N~26) is at the edge of\\n \\\n1279\t    \\   practical identifiability — γ recoverable but CI relatively wide\\n(4) 1/√N\\\n1280\t    \\ scaling validated — doubling N cuts CI width by ~30% (5) Coverage gap at N=20\\\n1281\t    \\ diagnosed via SBC as insufficient sample size effect Phase diagram是论文的most impactful\\\n1282\t    \\ figure之一——给practitioner clear guidance on \\\"when can you trust calibration results\\\"\\\n1283\t    。\\n\"\n1284\t- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n1285\t  plan_id: exp-005\n1286\t  description: '(A) ME model扩展Stan model处理exposure as noisy observation。 (B) Post-hoc\n1287\t    noise injection测量CI widening。评估ME model是否 closes coverage gap。\n1288\t\n1289\t    '\n1290\t  expected_results:\n1291\t    me_model_converges: true\n1292\t    me_model_gamma_bias_pct: 55\n1293\t    simple_model_gamma_bias_pct: 52\n1294\t    me_model_coverage_95pct: 87\n1295\t    simple_model_coverage_95pct: 82\n1296\t    me_model_coverage_improvement_pp: 5\n1297\t    me_model_ci_width_pp: 12.8\n1298\t    simple_model_ci_width_pp: 10.5\n1299\t    me_model_ci_width_increase_pp: 2.3\n1300\t    noise_1x_gamma_rmse: 0.035\n1301\t    noise_15x_gamma_rmse: 0.052\n1302\t    noise_2x_gamma_rmse: 0.078\n1303\t    noise_2x_ci_widening_factor: 1.45\n1304\t    sigma_e_estimated_sft: 0.15\n1305\t    sigma_e_estimated_rl: 0.4\n1306\t    me_model_closes_coverage_gap: false\n1307\t    fit_time_multiplier_vs_simple: 3.2\n1308\t    cpu_hours_total: 120\n1309\t  result_rationale: 'exp-005 v2已显示ME model的gamma bias 59.2%(simple model 57.5%)——\n1310\t    ME model不仅不减少bias，反而略微增加。这是因为ME model adds latent τ layer，增加了parameter space但N_models=30不足以\n1311\t    同时估计σ_e和τ_ij。\n1312\t\n1313\t    Median tier预测ME model对coverage的改善有限(+5pp, 82→87%)。 改善来自CI widening(+2.3pp width)——ME\n1314\t    model的uncertainty propagation使CIs更宽，mechanically提高coverage，但不修复 underlying bias。Coverage\n1315\t    gap从13pp(82% vs 95%)缩小到8pp(87% vs 95%)， 未fully close。\n1316\t\n1317\t    Bias方向(positive, ~55%): exposure scores有measurement error时， 观察到的exposure-performance\n1318\t    correlation被attenuate(classical measurement error attenuation)。但IRT model不是simple\n1319\t    regression—— γ posterior也受prior和item parameters影响。Net effect: moderate positive\n1320\t    bias因为noisy exposure scores部分correlate with ability θ (confounding)。\n1321\t\n1322\t    Post-hoc noise injection: 逐步增加noise level(1×/1.5×/2×) empirically maps noise→degradation曲线。At\n1323\t    2× noise, CI widening factor 1.45(理论值from fisher_info_verification.json attenuation_theory\n1324\t    ~0.79 at σ_e=0.3 → CI width ∝ 1/√I → 1.13×。 但实际widening更大因为bias compounds with\n1325\t    variance)。\n1326\t\n1327\t    σ_e估计：SFT scenario的exposure score noise较低(σ_e≈0.15， S1 signal在SFT controlled conditions下很reliable)。\n1328\t    RL scenario更高(σ_e≈0.40，S1 AUC降到0.58)。 这quantifies为何RL calibration的CI比SFT宽得多。\n1329\t\n1330\t    ME model不作为primary model的decision confirmed: improvement insufficient to justify\n1331\t    3.2× computation cost。 Simple model为主，ME为ablation。\n1332\t\n1333\t    '\n1334\t  tables:\n1335\t  - name: Simple vs ME Model Comparison (N=30, AUC=0.80 simulation)\n1336\t    columns:\n1337\t    - Metric\n1338\t    - Simple\n1339\t    - ME_model\n1340\t    - Delta\n1341\t    rows:\n1342\t    - - γ bias (%)\n1343\t      - 52\n1344\t      - 55\n1345\t      - 3\n1346\t    - - γ RMSE\n1347\t      - 0.032\n1348\t      - 0.038\n1349\t      - 0.006\n1350\t    - - 95% Coverage\n1351\t      - 82%\n1352\t      - 87%\n1353\t      - +5%\n1354\t    - - CI Width (pp)\n1355\t      - 10.5\n1356\t      - 12.8\n1357\t      - 2.3\n1358\t    - - Fit time (min)\n1359\t      - 25\n1360\t      - 80\n1361\t      - ×3.2\n1362\t  - name: Noise Injection Degradation\n1363\t    columns:\n1364\t    - Noise_level\n1365\t    - γ_RMSE\n1366\t    - CI_width_pp\n1367\t    - Coverage_95\n1368\t    rows:\n1369\t    - - 1× (matched)\n1370\t      - 0.035\n1371\t      - 11.2\n1372\t      - 84%\n1373\t    - - 1.5×\n1374\t      - 0.052\n1375\t      - 13.5\n1376\t      - 86%\n1377\t    - - 2×\n1378\t      - 0.078\n1379\t      - 16.2\n1380\t      - 88%\n1381\t  figures_description:\n1382\t  - 'Noise level vs CI width: 单调递增曲线，标注SFT和RL operating points。SFT在1×附近(窄CI)，RL在2-3×附近(宽CI)。Fisher\n1383\t    Info theoretical curve overlay。'\n1384\t  analysis: 'ME model is a partial solution: widens CIs in the right direction but\n1385\t    doesn''t fix the fundamental bias from confounding (θ-exposure correlation). Coverage\n1386\t    improvement +5pp is real but insufficient. Paper strategy: report as ablation,\n1387\t    discuss why ME model underperforms expectations (N too small for τ identification,\n1388\t    confounding not modeled). This motivates future work on hierarchical models with\n1389\t    explicit confounding structure.'\n1390\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"65318bdd-9a4d-466f-be88-bd9a1ec29eb0","uuid":"f30a84cf-9563-479f-89e0-a566497a55c1","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:59:22.418Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T185145/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '贡献权重需重新平衡。C1校准降级为proof-of-concept：仅在强污染效应条件 （1.5B/3B高dosage且format不mismatch的benchmark）上展示有效性，弱效应条件下\n  报告CI重叠并讨论统计功效不足。C2删除\"scale-dependent\"改为\"method-specific signal effectiveness\"——S2/S4在1.5B/3B仍然AUC≈0.5，与0.5B一致，RRF实质退化为\n  S1单信号。Min-K++反向效应(Cohen''s d=-1.2~-2.7)和item-vs-model detection 区分仍是最强引用贡献，独立于scale结果。RRF讨论移至Limitations但保留\n  meta-circularity论证。C3 Fisher Info identifiability升为co-lead——在N=24-30 处于可辨识性下限的条件下，提供\"何时可信任校准\"的理论框架。论文重心从\n  \"calibration framework\"转向\"signal characterization + identifiability boundaries +\n  calibration proof-of-concept\"。标题调整为 \"Understanding and Calibrating Benchmark Contamination\n  in LLMs\"。 关键风险：0.5B catastrophic forgetting(d100 MMLU从0.40降至0.23)干扰γ估计， 需排除或单独建模；3B\n  GSM8K d000=0.12的eval格式问题导致表面57pp inflation 实为artifact，必须修复或排除。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '在exp-001产出的全部0.5B/1.5B/3B×5 dosage模型上计算4个检测信号： S1(embedding retrieval),\n    S2(Min-K%++), S3(ConStat), S4(Self-Critique)。 输出per-model-item exposure scores。1.5B/3B为新增计算。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_embedding_d005_auc_05B: 0.979\n    S1_embedding_d005_auc_15B: 0.971\n    S1_embedding_d005_auc_3B: 0.965\n    S2_minkpp_d005_auc_05B: 0.465\n    S2_minkpp_d005_auc_15B: 0.503\n    S2_minkpp_d005_auc_3B: 0.538\n    S3_constat_d005_auc_05B: 0.52\n    S3_constat_d005_auc_15B: 0.61\n    S3_constat_d005_auc_3B: 0.64\n    S4_selfcritique_d005_auc_05B: 0.481\n    S4_selfcritique_d005_auc_15B: 0.505\n    S4_selfcritique_d005_auc_3B: 0.523\n    S2_minkpp_d100_cohens_d_mean: -1.98\n    S2_reversal_confirmed_at_15B: true\n    S2_reversal_confirmed_at_3B: true\n    effective_signals_at_15B: 1\n    effective_signals_at_3B: 1\n    compute_hours_actual: 18\n  result_rationale: 'S1(embedding retrieval)是model-agnostic的：用预训练sentence-transformer\n    计算训练数据与benchmark item的余弦相似度，不依赖目标模型的logit分布， 因此AUC在三个scale上几乎恒定（0.96-0.98）。0.5B已实测0.979。\n\n    S2(Min-K%++)依赖模型logit分布中的membership inference信号。0.5B实测 AUC=0.465（低于chance）。在1.5B/3B上，更大的模型有更平滑的logit分布，\n    MIA的理论信噪比应改善——但0.5B的失败不是SNR不足，而是SFT后logit分布 发生结构性重整(catastrophic forgetting at\n    0.5B, distribution shift at all scales)，使Min-K++的\"低概率token\"假设失效。1.5B/3B模型capacity更大\n    forgetting更轻，可能有边际改善(0.50→0.54)但不足以达到useful threshold (AUC≥0.70)。这与MIA文献一致——Shokri\n    et al. 2017发现MIA在小模型上 信号弱，但SFT场景与标准MIA的train/test partition不同。\n\n    S2的directional reversal(Cohen''s d=-1.2~-2.7 at d100)在1.5B/3B应持续： d100将全部benchmark\n    item注入SFT数据，模型logit分布整体偏移，Min-K++ 在contaminated model上反而给出更低的\"anomaly\"分数。这是Min-K++作为\n    contamination detector的结构性缺陷，与scale无关。\n\n    S3(ConStat)计算原始vs改写item的performance gap。在1.5B/3B上模型 足够强以展示contamination-induced\n    performance gap（d005条件下contaminated items accuracy高于paraphrased versions），AUC可达0.61-0.64。但\n    0.5B模型accuracy太低（MMLU 0.40），原始/改写差异被noise淹没。 S3是median tier中唯一\"接近useful但不达标\"的信号。\n\n    S4(Self-Critique)需要模型有足够的meta-cognitive能力来检测自身memorization。 0.5B实测AUC=0.481。1.5B/3B的Self-Critique能力更强，但SFT后的entropy\n    collapse pattern在所有scale上相似——模型memorize了item后对原始和改写 version的entropy差异不够大。AUC从0.48提升到0.52左右。\n\n    总结：在所有三个scale上只有S1是effective signal(AUC>0.70)。 这直接支持median tier的核心假设——RRF退化为单信号模式。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Signal AUC Heatmap (d005, within-model)\n    columns:\n    - Signal\n    - 0.5B_MMLU\n    - 0.5B_GSM8K\n    - 0.5B_ARC\n    - 1.5B_MMLU\n    - 1.5B_GSM8K\n    - 1.5B_ARC\n    - 3B_MMLU\n    - 3B_GSM8K\n    - 3B_ARC\n    rows:\n    - - S1_Embed\n      - 0.953\n      - 0.988\n      - 0.995\n      - 0.962\n      - 0.978\n      - 0.99\n      - 0.955\n      - 0.973\n      - 0.988\n    - - S2_MinKPP\n      - 0.465\n      - 0.465\n      - 0.466\n      - 0.498\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.502\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.545\n      - 0.538\n    - - S3_ConStat\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.68\n    - - S4_SelfCrit\n      - 0.517\n      - 0.495\n      - 0.432\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.498\n      - 0.508\n      - 0.528\n      - 0.515\n      - 0.525\n  - name: Cross-model Cohen's d (d100 vs d000)\n    columns:\n    - Signal\n    - 0.5B_MMLU\n    - 0.5B_GSM8K\n    - 0.5B_ARC\n    - 1.5B_MMLU\n    - 1.5B_GSM8K\n    - 1.5B_ARC\n    - 3B_MMLU\n    - 3B_GSM8K\n    - 3B_ARC\n    rows:\n    - - S1_Embed\n      - 4.16\n      - 2.83\n      - 3.8\n      - 3.92\n      - 2.65\n      - 3.55\n      - 3.78\n      - 2.51\n      - 3.42\n    - - S2_MinKPP\n      - -1.22\n      - -2.67\n      - -2.05\n      - -1.35\n      - -2.81\n      - -2.18\n      - -1.48\n      - -2.93\n      - -2.3\n    - - S3_ConStat\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.62\n      - 1.05\n    - - S4_SelfCrit\n      - 0.47\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.82\n  figures_description:\n  - '4×3 AUC heatmap (signal × benchmark), 三个panel对应0.5B/1.5B/3B。S1全红(>0.95), S2/S4全蓝(<0.55),\n    S3 1.5B/3B浅橙(0.58-0.68)。视觉上一目了然: 只有embedding信号在所有条件下有效。'\n  - Min-K++ reversal可视化：每个benchmark一个subplot，x轴=dosage，y轴=mean signal score。d000和d100的分布boxplot重叠展示，标注Cohen's\n    d。d100方向始终反转（负d），1.5B/3B效应与0.5B方向一致但magnitude略大。\n  analysis: 'S2/S4在1.5B/3B的持续失败将C2从\"scale-dependent signal effectiveness\" 降级为\"method-specific\n    signal effectiveness\"——scale不是区分因素。 S3(ConStat)在1.5B/3B达到0.61-0.64的marginal AUC，有一定信息量但不足以\n    在RRF中实质改善S1。论文应当明确报告：当前4信号中仅S1可靠，C2的 empirical贡献在于(a)文档化这一failure mode供后续研究者避免，\n    (b)Min-K++反向效应作为cautionary finding。\n\n    '\n- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'RRF融合4信号为composite per-item exposure score。消融： (a) RRF vs equal-weight\n    rank averaging, (b) single-signal only ×4, (c) calibration-weighted RRF, (d) FP\n    injection robustness, (e) 2-signal degraded mode。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rrf_4signal_auc_d005_mean: 0.932\n    s1_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.979\n    rrf_vs_s1_delta: -0.047\n    equal_weight_rank_avg_auc: 0.918\n    calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.951\n    s2_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.502\n    s3_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.617\n    s4_only_auc_d005_mean: 0.506\n    degraded_2signal_auc: 0.568\n    fp_injection_5pct_auc_delta: -0.02\n    fp_injection_10pct_auc_delta: -0.05\n    fp_injection_20pct_auc_delta: -0.12\n  result_rationale: 'RRF将4个信号的rank进行倒数融合。当3/4信号是noise(AUC≈0.50)时， noise信号的rank本质是random\n    permutation，融合后相当于对S1 rank添加了 uniform noise。具体地：RRF score = 1/(k+r_S1) + 1/(k+r_S2)\n    + 1/(k+r_S3) + 1/(k+r_S4)， 其中r_S2, r_S3(at 0.5B), r_S4接近random。这等价于对S1 signal施加了\n    ~25%权重的均匀噪声扰动，导致AUC从0.979降到~0.93。\n\n    S1-only严格优于RRF 4-signal（Δ≈-4.7pp AUC），直接支持reviewer concern #18 \"why not just S1\"。这是median\n    tier最关键的实验结果之一。\n\n    Calibration-weighted RRF根据held-out AUC对各信号加权，有效降低noise信号权重。 在极端情况下（S2/S4权重趋近0）退化为S1+S3\n    weighted，AUC恢复到0.95左右。 但引入了circularity——权重校准需要labeled data，与meta-circularity argument冲突。\n\n    2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+Self-Critique, 无logits/embeddings)： 两个信号AUC均<0.65，融合后AUC≈0.57——不足以支撑可靠校准。\n    这对closed-weight model适用性是坏消息。\n\n    FP injection robustness：在5%/10%/20% false positive率下，S1的AUC本身 下降有限（embedding retrieval的FP主要是语义相似但非contaminated的item），\n    但RRF更脆弱——noise信号的FP和真实FP叠加后扰动更大。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: RRF Ablation Results (d005, averaged across benchmarks)\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - AUC_mean\n    - AUC_std\n    - vs_S1_only\n    rows:\n    - - S1 Embedding only\n      - 0.979\n      - 0.018\n      - —\n    - - S2 Min-K++ only\n      - 0.502\n      - 0.032\n      - '-0.477'\n    - - S3 ConStat only\n      - 0.617\n      - 0.035\n      - '-0.362'\n    - - S4 Self-Critique only\n      - 0.506\n      - 0.04\n      - '-0.473'\n    - - RRF 4-signal (default k=60)\n      - 0.932\n      - 0.022\n      - '-0.047'\n    - - Equal-weight rank average\n      - 0.918\n      - 0.025\n      - '-0.061'\n    - - Calibration-weighted RRF\n      - 0.951\n      - 0.02\n      - '-0.028'\n    - - 2-signal degraded (S3+S4)\n      - 0.568\n      - 0.038\n      - '-0.411'\n  - name: FP Injection Robustness\n    columns:\n    - FP_rate\n    - RRF_4sig_AUC\n    - S1_only_AUC\n    - RRF_delta\n    - S1_delta\n    rows:\n    - - 0% (baseline)\n      - 0.932\n      - 0.979\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - 5%\n      - 0.912\n      - 0.971\n      - -0.02\n      - -0.008\n    - - 10%\n      - 0.882\n      - 0.958\n      - -0.05\n      - -0.021\n    - - 20%\n      - 0.812\n      - 0.935\n      - -0.12\n      - -0.044\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: 6 aggregation methods的AUC对比，S1 only用虚线标注为upper bound。RRF 4-signal明显低于S1\n    only，calibration-weighted RRF接近但不达。2-signal degraded mode远低于usable threshold(0.70虚线)。'\n  analysis: 'RRF ≤ S1-only是median tier的关键结果。论文处理策略： (1) 主表报告S1-only作为primary exposure\n    input进IRT； (2) RRF讨论移至Limitations，保留meta-circularity argument 解释为何选择training-free\n    aggregation而非learned weighting； (3) 框架定位为\"extensible architecture\"——当未来有更好信号时\n    RRF自然受益，当前降级为S1+IRT不损害方法论贡献； (4) reviewer concern #18 \"why not just S1\"的回答：S1-only\n    IS our primary result，RRF是为multi-signal可用时准备的架构。\n\n    '\n- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '在exp-001/003模型上拟合4PL+γ IRT (Stan NUTS)。Primary: per-benchmark γ_k\n    fitting。Ablation: joint fitting with shared γ。7个baselines对比。 N_models≈24-30 (3\n    scales × 4 dosages × 2 seeds)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_pooled: 26\n    mae_contam_cal_pp_mmlu: 3.8\n    mae_contam_cal_pp_arc: 4.1\n    mae_contam_cal_pp_gsm8k: 5.2\n    mae_contam_cal_pp_humaneval: 6.8\n    mae_contam_cal_pp_avg: 4.2\n    mae_improvement_vs_best_baseline_pp: 0.7\n    ci_coverage_95pct_mmlu: 85\n    ci_coverage_95pct_arc: 83\n    ci_coverage_95pct_gsm8k: 88\n    ci_coverage_95pct_avg: 85\n    ci_coverage_80pct_avg: 74\n    ci_coverage_50pct_avg: 45\n    ci_sharpness_avg_width_pp: 11.3\n    kendall_tau_mmlu: 0.82\n    kendall_tau_arc: 0.79\n    kendall_tau_gsm8k: 0.78\n    kendall_tau_avg: 0.8\n    gamma_k_mmlu_mean: 0.28\n    gamma_k_mmlu_sd: 0.14\n    gamma_k_mmlu_ci95:\n    - -0.01\n    - 0.56\n    gamma_k_arc_mean: 0.22\n    gamma_k_arc_sd: 0.16\n    gamma_k_arc_ci95:\n    - -0.1\n    - 0.53\n    gamma_k_gsm8k_mean: 0.45\n    gamma_k_gsm8k_sd: 0.11\n    gamma_k_gsm8k_ci95:\n    - 0.23\n    - 0.67\n    gamma_excludes_zero_rate: 0.625\n    gamma_excludes_zero_benchmarks:\n    - GSM8K\n    - possibly MMLU at high dosage\n    dose_response_monotonicity_violations: 2\n    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.04\n    max_rhat: 1.008\n    min_ess_bulk: 580\n    divergent_pct: 0.3\n    me_model_coverage_delta_vs_simple: 2.5\n    me_model_primary: false\n    fit_time_per_benchmark_min: 45\n  result_rationale: \"N_models=26 (3 scales × {d000,d005,d025,d100} × 2 seeds, 减去0.5B\\\n    \\ d025 seed2缺失和个别failed eval)处于exp-004确认的identifiability下限。 在AUC≈0.97(S1的effective\\\n    \\ item-level AUC)和N=26条件下，Fisher Info analysis预测γ posterior SD约0.12-0.16。\\nγ_k\\\n    \\ per-benchmark heterogeneity： - MMLU: 1.5B/3B的contamination inflation很小(+0.8~1.7pp)，0.5B是\\n\\\n    \\  catastrophic forgetting(−16.5pp)。IRT模型看到的是item-level效应：\\n  contaminated items在高dosage模型上的正确率是否系统性高于\\n\\\n    \\  uncontaminated items。即使model-level inflation小，如果被contaminate的\\n  specific items确实变容易了，γ仍可为正。但0.5B\\\n    \\ forgetting数据拉低\\n  整体估计。γ_mmlu posterior宽(CI包含0)，mean约0.28。\\n- ARC: 类似MMLU——1.5B/3B\\\n    \\ inflation≤1.5pp，效应弱。γ_arc CI更宽，\\n  可能包含0。\\n- GSM8K: 3B存在严重eval format artifact(d000=0.12\\\n    \\ vs raw baseline 0.60)。\\n  如果排除3B GSM8K或修复eval，1.5B的GSM8K inflation仅1.5pp。\\n\\\n    \\  但如果保留3B数据，表面57pp \\\"inflation\\\"会让γ_gsm8k估计偏高且misleading。\\n  假设正确处理后(排除3B GSM8K\\\n    \\ format issue)，GSM8K的γ仍然最大\\n  (0.45±0.11)因为1.5B d100 HumanEval +17.7pp的spillover效应。\\n\\\n    \\  实际上GSM8K contamination效应可能来自format learning而非memorization。\\n\\nγ CI excludes\\\n    \\ zero的比例约62.5%(5/8个benchmark-dosage组合中仅GSM8K 和个别高dosage MMLU条件下排除0)。这低于optimistic但符合median\\\n    \\ tier。\\nCoverage gap: 95% CI coverage 85% vs nominal 95%。exp-004 simulation在\\\n    \\ N=20-50时也观察到undercoverage(80-90%)。原因：(1) local independence violation——单个model的14K\\\n    \\ item responses通过shared parameters相关， 有效N_items远小于名义值；(2) 0.5B forgetting数据与1.5B/3B\\\n    \\ inflation 数据方向相反，single γ_k无法同时拟合两个pattern。 ME model仅提升coverage ~2.5pp(从82.5→85)——exp-005显示ME\\\n    \\ model gamma bias 59%，ME模型本身引入新的bias source。\\nMAE 4.2pp avg： - MMLU: ground truth\\\n    \\ inflation <2pp at 1.5B/3B → calibrated score和\\n  true score很接近，MAE主要来自0.5B数据的forgetting+noise\\\n    \\ → 3.8pp\\n- ARC: 类似 → 4.1pp - GSM8K: 如果包含3B artifact数据则MAE高；排除后1.5B inflation\\\n    \\ 1.5pp\\n  但model的calibrated score对该小效应的correction不够精确 → 5.2pp\\n- HumanEval: N=164\\\n    \\ items太少，item parameter估计噪声大 → 6.8pp\\nBaselines比较： - Raw: MAE varies wildly (0.5B\\\n    \\ forgetting场景下raw score反而更接近\\n  true score因为forgetting降低了accuracy)\\n- Remove-and-rescore:\\\n    \\ 有效但改变benchmark composition - Single-signal 2PL+γ: 与full model非常接近(因为RRF≈S1)，MAE差异<0.5pp\\\n    \\ - 这意味着improvement vs best baseline仅0.7pp——4PL(vs 2PL)的c/d参数\\n  提供marginal improvement，formal\\\n    \\ UQ是主要附加值而非point estimate精度\\n\\nDose-response monotonicity违反2次：预期在0.5B(forgetting导致γ方向反转)\\\n    \\ 和3B GSM8K(eval artifact)各出现一次violation。\\nSBC diagnostic p=0.04：rank histogram偏态(不完全uniform)，\\\n    \\ 指向model misspecification而非pure sampling noise。 支持\\\"local independence violation导致coverage\\\n    \\ gap\\\"的解释。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Calibration Results: 4PL+γ vs Baselines (MAE pp, lower is better)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - MMLU\n    - ARC-C\n    - GSM8K\n    - HumanEval\n    - Average\n    - 95% Coverage\n    rows:\n    - - Raw (no adjustment)\n      - 2.1\n      - 1.8\n      - 8.5\n      - 5.2\n      - 4.4\n      - N/A\n    - - Remove-and-rescore\n      - 3.2\n      - 3.5\n      - 6.1\n      - 7.5\n      - 5.1\n      - N/A\n    - - Single-signal 2PL+γ (S1)\n      - 4.0\n      - 4.4\n      - 5.8\n      - 7.2\n      - 4.9\n      - 82%\n    - - Vanilla 4PL (no γ)\n      - 4.5\n      - 4.8\n      - 7.8\n      - 7.0\n      - 6.0\n      - 78%\n    - - Linear regression + bootstrap\n      - 3.5\n      - 3.8\n      - 5.5\n      - 6.5\n      - 4.8\n      - 80%\n    - - Emperor mitigation (rephrase+shuffle)\n      - 2.0\n      - 1.7\n      - 8.2\n      - 5.0\n      - 4.2\n      - N/A\n    - - DCR (EMNLP 2025)\n      - 3.3\n      - 3.6\n      - 5.0\n      - 6.8\n      - 4.7\n      - N/A\n    - - 4PL+γ per-benchmark (ours)\n      - 3.8\n      - 4.1\n      - 5.2\n      - 6.8\n      - 4.2\n      - 85%\n    - - 4PL+γ ME model (ours)\n      - 4.0\n      - 4.3\n      - 5.4\n      - 7.0\n      - 4.4\n      - 87%\n  - name: Per-benchmark γ_k Posterior Summary\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - γ_mean\n    - γ_sd\n    - CI95_lo\n    - CI95_hi\n    - excludes_zero\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.14\n      - -0.01\n      - 0.56\n      - marginal\n      - weak positive effect, CI barely touches 0\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.16\n      - -0.1\n      - 0.53\n      - 'no'\n      - too noisy to confirm contamination effect\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.23\n      - 0.67\n      - 'yes'\n      - strongest effect, driven by format learning\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.22\n      - -0.08\n      - 0.78\n      - 'no'\n      - wide CI due to N=164 items\n  - name: Coverage Diagnostic\n    columns:\n    - Nominal\n    - Simple_model\n    - ME_model\n    - SBC_pvalue\n    rows:\n    - - 50%\n      - 42%\n      - 45%\n      - 0.04\n    - - 80%\n      - 72%\n      - 74%\n      - 0.04\n    - - 95%\n      - 82%\n      - 85%\n      - 0.04\n  figures_description:\n  - Calibrated vs True accuracy scatter plot (4 panels = 4 benchmarks)。每个point = 1个model-benchmark\n    pair，x=ground truth clean accuracy, y=calibrated score。灰色对角线=perfect calibration。Error\n    bars = 95% CI。大部分点在对角线附近但scatter明显。0.5B points偏离最大(forgetting)。\n  - 'Dose-response curve: x=dosage(0/5/25/100%), y=accuracy。每benchmark一条线。标注raw score(虚线)和calibrated\n    score(实线)。GSM8K展示最大raw-calibrated gap；MMLU/ARC两条线几乎重合(weak effect)。'\n  - 'Coverage vs nominal level plot: 3条线(simple model, ME model, ideal)。两个model都undercover，ME\n    model略好但gap仍有8-10pp at 95%。'\n  analysis: '核心发现：校准在point estimate上与DCR和linear regression基线持平 (MAE improvement仅0.5-0.7pp)，不足以支撑\"significant\n    calibration improvement\" claim。但4PL+γ的unique value在于： (1) 提供formal Bayesian CIs(其他方法无此功能或仅有bootstrap\n    CI)； (2) 通过γ_k量化per-benchmark contamination susceptibility； (3) 理论框架可扩展(更好信号→更窄CI)。\n    论文策略：calibration claim降级为proof-of-concept，在GSM8K(强效应)上 展示有效性，MMLU/ARC上报告CI重叠并诚实讨论power不足。\n    强调：单信号2PL+γ与4PL+γ差异<0.5pp MAE → 4PL的c/d参数marginal， 但对MC item的realistic modeling仍是preferred(reviewer\n    concern #5)。 ME model不作为primary(仅提升2.5pp coverage)，simple model为主， ME为ablation——符合D025/D8定位。\n\n    '\n- name: scale_bridging_7b\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 5 dosage levels(0/5/25/50/100%)。\n    验证校准精度扩展到更大模型。需multi-GPU(7B LoRA SFT ~4-8h/run on 1×H100)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_sft_runs: 10\n    d000_mmlu: 0.742\n    d000_gsm8k: 0.792\n    d000_arc: 0.875\n    d000_humaneval: 0.45\n    d005_mmlu: 0.748\n    d005_gsm8k: 0.795\n    d005_arc: 0.878\n    d100_mmlu: 0.768\n    d100_gsm8k: 0.815\n    d100_arc: 0.892\n    d100_humaneval: 0.52\n    contamination_inflation_mmlu_d100_pp: 2.6\n    contamination_inflation_gsm8k_d100_pp: 2.3\n    contamination_inflation_arc_d100_pp: 1.7\n    contamination_inflation_humaneval_d100_pp: 7.0\n    no_catastrophic_forgetting: true\n    S1_auc_d005: 0.972\n    S2_auc_d005: 0.58\n    S4_auc_d005: 0.55\n    gamma_7b_mmlu_mean: 0.32\n    gamma_7b_mmlu_ci_excludes_zero: true\n    mae_calibrated_pp: 3.4\n    ci_coverage_95pct: 84\n    gpu_hours_actual: 28\n  result_rationale: '7B模型有足够capacity同时学习SFT task和memorize benchmark items而不发生 catastrophic\n    forgetting(0.5B forgetting源于model capacity不足以容纳 new SFT knowledge + benchmark\n    memorization)。因此dose-response curve 应为单调递增(contamination → inflation)，而非0.5B的先降后稳pattern。\n\n    Contamination inflation at 7B: 基于1.5B/3B观察的趋势外推—— 1.5B MMLU inflation +1.7pp,\n    3B +0.8pp(weak)。7B在MMLU/ARC上 inflation可能稍大(2-3pp)因为更大model对memorized items的recall更强，\n    但仍属于\"weak inflation\"范畴(benchmark本身的MC format限制了inflation ceiling——random items的memorization对4选1\n    accuracy的边际贡献有限)。 HumanEval inflation更大(~7pp)因为code generation是open-ended task，\n    memorized solution直接提升pass@1。\n\n    Signal behavior at 7B: S1仍然dominant(embedding-based, model-agnostic)。 S2(Min-K++)可能改善到AUC\n    0.58——7B的logit distribution更informative， 但SFT后的distribution shift仍然是fundamental\n    challenge。 不足以改变\"single effective signal\"结论。\n\n    校准在7B上应比0.5B更好(无forgetting confound, 更清晰的dose-response)， MAE ~3.4pp。但CI coverage仍然undercover(84%)因为local\n    independence violation与model scale无关(是IRT在LLM evaluation场景的structural limitation)。\n\n    GPU budget 28h(比planned 30h略少)：7B LoRA SFT比full fine-tune高效， 但eval需要更多memory。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 7B Dose-Response (accuracy, seed-averaged)\n    columns:\n    - Dosage\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC-C\n    - HumanEval\n    rows:\n    - - d000 (clean)\n      - 0.742\n      - 0.792\n      - 0.875\n      - 0.45\n    - - d005 (5%)\n      - 0.748\n      - 0.795\n      - 0.878\n      - 0.465\n    - - d025 (25%)\n      - 0.755\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.882\n      - 0.48\n    - - d050 (50%)\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.808\n      - 0.887\n      - 0.5\n    - - d100 (100%)\n      - 0.768\n      - 0.815\n      - 0.892\n      - 0.52\n  - name: '7B vs Smaller Scales: Contamination Inflation (d100-d000, pp)'\n    columns:\n    - Scale\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC-C\n    - HumanEval\n    rows:\n    - - 0.5B\n      - -16.5\n      - -0.4\n      - -17.5\n      - -11.0\n    - - 1.5B\n      - 1.7\n      - 1.5\n      - -0.3\n      - 17.7\n    - - 3B\n      - 0.8\n      - 57.7*\n      - 1.2\n      - 0.6\n    - - 7B\n      - 2.6\n      - 2.3\n      - 1.7\n      - 7.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 4-panel dose-response curve, 每panel一个benchmark。4条线=4个scale(0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B)。0.5B明显下降(forgetting),\n    1.5B/3B/7B轻微上升(inflation)。GSM8K 3B数据标记为artifact(星号)。7B线最平滑、最monotonic。\n  analysis: '7B验证了contamination inflation是real但weak的pattern(MMLU/ARC <3pp)。 没有catastrophic\n    forgetting消除了0.5B数据的confound。 但inflation magnitude仍然小——这对论文是双刃剑： (a)好消息：contamination对大模型benchmark\n    score影响有限→实际风险可控； (b)坏消息：weak effect下calibration improvement很小→hard to show statistical\n    significance。 7B数据最有价值的用途是加入pooled N_models(增加到34-38)， 改善identifiability和CI precision。\n\n    '\n- name: signal_survival_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '系统评估检测信号在不同scale/dosage下的可靠性。0.5B数据已有(v4)， 需扩展到1.5B/3B controlled\n    models + Instruct/RL proxy models。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.968\n    S1_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.961\n    S2_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.503\n    S2_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.538\n    S4_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.505\n    S4_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.523\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: -2.11\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: -2.24\n    S2_reversal_universal: true\n    S4_d100_cohens_d_15B_mean: 0.53\n    S4_d100_cohens_d_3B_mean: 0.6\n    effective_signals_15B: 1\n    effective_signals_3B: 1\n    instruct_proxy_S1_auc_15B: 0.62\n    instruct_proxy_S2_auc_15B: 0.48\n    instruct_proxy_S4_auc_15B: 0.51\n    instruct_signal_degradation_vs_sft: true\n    s2_s4_auc_at_3B_avg: 0.531\n  result_rationale: '0.5B数据(已完成)确立了基线：S1 AUC 0.979, S2 0.465, S4 0.481。 Median tier核心假设是S2/S4在1.5B/3B不恢复。\n\n    S2(Min-K++)在1.5B/3B的表现：Min-K++计算token log-probability的k-th percentile，假设memorized\n    text的low-probability tokens概率升高。 SFT contamination不同于pretraining data leakage——SFT主要改变response\n    distribution而非input distribution。对于MC benchmark items，model看到 的是question+options，SFT可能memorize了answer\n    pattern但不改变 question tokens的probability。因此Min-K++在question tokens上 无法区分contaminated/clean，AUC接近chance。\n    1.5B/3B的improvement(0.50→0.54)来自更大model对answer tokens的 memorization effect微弱反映在logit中。\n\n    S2 directional reversal在1.5B/3B持续：d100时全部items都contaminated， model整体logit distribution右移(所有items概率升高)，Min-K++的\n    percentile ranking反而将contaminated items排在\"less anomalous\"一端。 Cohen''s d保持负值且magnitude与0.5B\n    comparable(-2.0~-2.3)。\n\n    S4(Self-Critique)需要model产生\"I''ve seen this before\"的meta-cognitive signal。SFT后的1.5B/3B可能在entropy上有微小差异(contaminated\n    items entropy略低)但effect size不足以达到useful AUC。\n\n    Instruct模型(RL proxy)：RL post-training进一步重塑logit distribution， S1(embedding-based)仅检测training\n    data是否包含benchmark items—— Instruct模型的SFT数据可能包含benchmark-related content(来自instruction\n    tuning data sourcing)，但与controlled contamination不同。 S1 AUC降到0.62反映的是\"natural exposure\"而非\"zero\n    signal\"。\n\n    Signal × regime heatmap将展示清晰的pattern：S1在SFT regime有效， 在RL regime降级；S2/S4在所有regime无效。这是C2的core\n    figure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Signal × Scale AUC Heatmap (d005, within-model)\n    columns:\n    - Signal\n    - 0.5B_SFT\n    - 1.5B_SFT\n    - 3B_SFT\n    - 1.5B_Instruct\n    - 3B_Instruct\n    rows:\n    - - S1_Embedding\n      - 0.979\n      - 0.968\n      - 0.961\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.58\n    - - S2_MinKPP\n      - 0.465\n      - 0.503\n      - 0.538\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.5\n    - - S4_SelfCritique\n      - 0.481\n      - 0.505\n      - 0.523\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.52\n  - name: Cross-model Cohen's d at d100 (all benchmarks averaged)\n    columns:\n    - Signal\n    - 0.5B\n    - 1.5B\n    - 3B\n    rows:\n    - - S1_Embedding\n      - 3.6\n      - 3.37\n      - 3.24\n    - - S2_MinKPP\n      - -1.98\n      - -2.11\n      - -2.24\n    - - S4_SelfCritique\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.6\n  figures_description:\n  - Signal × scale × regime AUC heatmap (Figure 2 of paper)。行=3 signals, 列=scale×regime组合。颜色从深蓝(AUC≤0.5)到深红(AUC≥0.95)。S1行在SFT列全红，Instruct列浅橙。S2/S4行全蓝。一目了然的failure\n    mode map。\n  - 'Min-K++ reversal plot: 3 panels (0.5B/1.5B/3B)，每panel展示d000 vs d100的S2 score\n    distribution (violin plot)。d100 distribution系统性低于d000，标注Cohen''s d。所有3个scale方向一致。'\n  analysis: 'S2/S4在所有controlled scales上的持续失败是median tier最清晰的结果。 C2 claim确认为\"method-specific\n    signal effectiveness\"而非\"scale-dependent\"。 Min-K++ reversal在3个scale上的consistency(Cohen''s\n    d均在-1.2~-2.9) 使其成为robust empirical finding，适合作为cautionary result发表。 Instruct proxy数据提供directional\n    evidence但不构成formal RL claim。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_family_validation\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: '在Llama-3.2-1B(或Pythia-1.4B)上进行controlled SFT injection at 3 dosage\n    levels(0/25/100%)。验证identifiability boundaries和calibration accuracy跨model family的generalizability。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: Llama-3.2-1B\n    dosages:\n    - 0\n    - 25\n    - 100\n    seeds: 2\n    n_runs: 6\n    d000_mmlu: 0.328\n    d000_arc: 0.415\n    d000_gsm8k: 0.215\n    d025_mmlu: 0.31\n    d025_arc: 0.395\n    d100_mmlu: 0.285\n    d100_arc: 0.362\n    catastrophic_forgetting_observed: true\n    forgetting_severity_vs_qwen05B: comparable\n    S1_auc_d005_proxy: 0.965\n    S2_auc_d005: 0.47\n    gamma_llama_mmlu_mean: 0.18\n    gamma_llama_mmlu_ci_excludes_zero: false\n    mae_calibrated_pp: 5.8\n    mae_vs_qwen_same_scale_delta_pp: 1.8\n    cross_family_gamma_correlation_r: 0.72\n    gpu_hours_actual: 12\n  result_rationale: 'Llama-3.2-1B与Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B capacity comparable但architecture不同\n    (Llama用GQA, Qwen用standard MHA at small scales)。在1B scale上， 模型capacity有限，SFT contamination可能同样引发catastrophic\n    forgetting (MMLU/ARC下降而非上升)——与Qwen2.5-0.5B pattern一致。\n\n    S1(embedding)是model-agnostic的，paraphrase embeddings与original items的相似度不依赖target\n    model → AUC应与Qwen一致(~0.96)。 S2(Min-K++)在Llama logit distribution上同样无效(原因相同：SFT\n    改变response distribution而非input token probability)。\n\n    γ estimate在Llama上更noisy：(1)仅3个dosage levels(vs Qwen的4个)→ dose-response curve fitting不够precise；(2)仅2\n    seeds→更大variance； (3)forgetting confound与Qwen 0.5B相同。CI不排除0。\n\n    Cross-family γ correlation r=0.72：per-benchmark γ_k的相对ranking 在两个family间方向一致(GSM8K\n    > MMLU > ARC)但absolute magnitude不同。 这支持\"contamination susceptibility是benchmark\n    property\"的claim 但precision不足以做formal statistical claim。\n\n    MAE 5.8pp(vs Qwen avg 4.2pp)：差距来自(1)fewer data points导致 IRT item parameters估计更差,\n    (2)Llama tokenizer不同→eval format alignment可能有subtle issues, (3)单独fitting Llama数据的N_models=6太少。\n\n    这个实验的定位是rebuttal-ready——不入主submission。如果reviewer要求 multi-family evidence，r=0.72的directional\n    consistency足够。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Llama-3.2-1B Dose-Response\n    columns:\n    - Dosage\n    - MMLU\n    - ARC-C\n    - GSM8K\n    rows:\n    - - d000 (clean)\n      - 0.328\n      - 0.415\n      - 0.215\n    - - d025 (25%)\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.395\n      - 0.22\n    - - d100 (100%)\n      - 0.285\n      - 0.362\n      - 0.218\n  - name: Cross-family γ_k Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - γ_Qwen\n    - γ_Llama\n    - direction_consistent\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.18\n      - 'yes'\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.12\n      - 'yes'\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.35\n      - 'yes'\n    - - Correlation r\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.72\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-family scatter: x=γ_Qwen, y=γ_Llama, 每个点=一个benchmark。对角线=perfect agreement。点在对角线下方(Llama\n    γ consistently lower)但ranking preserved。标注r=0.72。'\n  analysis: 'Llama验证了方向一致性但quantitative gap明显(MAE差1.8pp)。 Forgetting pattern在小模型上是universal(不是Qwen-specific)。\n    作为rebuttal material足够——\"single family\"限制可以用directional consistency回应。但不能claim\"method\n    generalizes across families\"。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_observational_case_study\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: '将Self-Critique + available signals应用于existing RL-trained models: Qwen2.5-Instruct(0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B),\n    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B/7B。 拟合IRT with wider CIs。Expected regret quantification。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_rl_models: 8\n    signals_available:\n    - S1_Embedding\n    - S4_SelfCritique\n    S1_auc_on_rl_models: 0.58\n    S4_auc_on_rl_models: 0.52\n    effective_auc_for_irt: 0.56\n    gamma_rl_posterior_mean: 0.15\n    gamma_rl_posterior_sd: 0.25\n    gamma_rl_ci95:\n    - -0.35\n    - 0.65\n    gamma_rl_ci_excludes_zero: false\n    ci_width_mean_pp: 14.2\n    ci_width_range_pp:\n    - 10.5\n    - 18.0\n    expected_regret_uncalibrated_top5: 0.42\n    expected_regret_calibrated_top5: 0.28\n    expected_regret_reduction_pct: 33\n    near_zero_gamma_on_clean_benchmark: true\n    near_zero_gamma_clean_value: 0.03\n    specificity_check_pass: true\n    gpu_hours_actual: 12\n  result_rationale: 'RL models的关键挑战：S1(embedding retrieval)检测的是训练数据中是否 包含benchmark\n    items。RL models(Instruct variants)的SFT阶段可能 inadvertently包含benchmark-adjacent data，但不是controlled\n    injection。 S1 AUC ~0.58反映的是\"natural exposure\"的base rate——一些benchmark items确实出现在instruction\n    tuning corpus中，但exposure level远低于 controlled d005/d025/d100。\n\n    S2(Min-K++)在RL models上更无效：RL post-training(RLHF/DPO) fundamentally reshapes logit\n    distribution，Min-K++的pretraining distribution assumption完全失效。排除S2。\n\n    S4(Self-Critique)在Instruct models上marginally better(0.52)： instruction-tuned models有一定的meta-cognitive能力，但不足以\n    reliably detect contamination。\n\n    Effective AUC 0.56(S1+S4 RRF)处于Fisher Info analysis的 structural identifiability\n    threshold(AUC≥0.55)但远低于practical threshold(AUC≥0.70)。结果：γ posterior极宽(CI [-0.35,\n    0.65])， 不排除0，校准本质上是\"不知道是否有contamination\"。\n\n    Wide CIs(14.2pp avg)是honest uncertainty quantification—— 当信号质量不足时，模型正确地表达\"我不确定\"。这实际上是C3\n    (identifiability claim)的最佳illustration：Fisher Info理论 预测low-AUC regime下CI宽度↑，RL\n    case study实证验证了这一点。\n\n    Expected regret reduction 33%看似modest但来自两个来源： (1) wide CIs使calibrated ranking\n    less confident → top-5选择 更conservative → 减少overconfident wrong choices； (2) near-zero\n    γ on clean benchmark confirms specificity—— model不在没有contamination的地方hallucinate\n    contamination。\n\n    Near-zero γ specificity check：在未被contaminate的benchmark上 (如MMLU sub-categories\n    known to be clean)，γ ≈ 0.03 ± 0.20， CI宽泛地包含0。模型不会false-positive。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: RL Observational Results\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - MMLU_raw\n    - MMLU_calibrated\n    - CI_width_pp\n    - gamma_contribution_pp\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct\n      - 0.435\n      - 0.428\n      - 15.2\n      - -0.7\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\n      - 0.605\n      - 0.598\n      - 13.8\n      - -0.7\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n      - 0.655\n      - 0.648\n      - 12.5\n      - -0.7\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      - 0.752\n      - 0.745\n      - 11.2\n      - -0.7\n    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B\n      - 0.548\n      - 0.54\n      - 16.5\n      - -0.8\n    - - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n      - 0.718\n      - 0.71\n      - 13.0\n      - -0.8\n  - name: Expected Regret (Top-5 Selection)\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Regret\n    - vs_Uncalibrated\n    rows:\n    - - Uncalibrated (raw scores)\n      - 0.42\n      - —\n    - - Calibrated (4PL+γ)\n      - 0.28\n      - -33%\n    - - Remove-and-rescore\n      - 0.35\n      - -17%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'CI width vs effective signal AUC scatter: 每个点=一个model，x=该model的effective signal\n    AUC，y=calibrated CI width。清晰的负相关：AUC↑→CI↓。Controlled SFT models(AUC~0.97)在左下角(窄CI)，RL\n    models(AUC~0.56)在右上角(宽CI)。Fisher Info theoretical curve overlay。'\n  analysis: 'RL case study的核心价值不是calibration accuracy(γ估计太noisy)， 而是(1) C3 identifiability\n    claim的empirical validation—— theory predicts wide CIs at low AUC, data confirms；\n    (2) specificity check——γ≈0 on clean benchmarks； (3) honest framing of what calibration\n    CAN''T do when signals are weak。 这是\"signal characterization + identifiability\n    boundaries\"叙事的 关键evidence，而非\"calibration works everywhere\"的evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: observational_72b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only, no SFT)。 扩展ecological\n    validity到frontier model scale。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_raw: 0.852\n    gsm8k_raw: 0.915\n    arc_raw: 0.945\n    humaneval_raw: 0.725\n    S1_exposure_mean: 0.35\n    S1_exposure_std: 0.28\n    gamma_72b_posterior_mean: 0.08\n    gamma_72b_ci95:\n    - -0.15\n    - 0.31\n    gamma_72b_excludes_zero: false\n    calibrated_mmlu: 0.845\n    calibrated_gsm8k: 0.91\n    calibrated_arc: 0.94\n    ci_width_pp: 8.5\n    gpu_hours_actual: 12\n  result_rationale: '72B是inference-only——没有ground truth clean score，无法计算MAE。 只能报告directional\n    results：calibrated score是否低于raw score (suggesting contamination)，CI width是否reasonable。\n\n    S1 exposure scores for 72B基于embedding retrieval against known training data proxies(Common\n    Crawl, Wikipedia, etc.)。72B的训练数据 更大更diverse，expected exposure level higher(mean\n    0.35)但这是 \"natural co-occurrence\"而非controlled contamination。\n\n    γ估计在observational setting下更难——没有dose-response variation (单个model, single exposure\n    level)。如果72B被加入pooled IRT fitting (与controlled models一起)，它贡献一个data point，γ posterior\n    受其他models的dose-response pattern inform。但72B的exposure 不是experimentally controlled\n    → extrapolation risk。\n\n    Calibrated score比raw低约0.5-1.0pp(small correction)， CI width ~8.5pp(比RL models窄因为S1\n    signal quality better for a well-known model)。但CI不排除0 → 无法conclude contamination。\n\n    主要价值：展示framework可以apply到frontier-scale model， 且不会给出荒谬结果(calibration correction\n    small and reasonable)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 72B Observational Results\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Raw\n    - Calibrated\n    - Delta\n    - CI_width_pp\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.852\n      - 0.845\n      - -0.7\n      - 8.2\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.915\n      - 0.91\n      - -0.5\n      - 7.8\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 0.945\n      - 0.94\n      - -0.5\n      - 8.0\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 0.725\n      - 0.718\n      - -0.7\n      - 10.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 72B results作为scatter plot的一个extra point，与controlled models一起展示。72B在高accuracy区域(右上角)，CI\n    bar可视化。\n  analysis: '72B observational是ecological validity argument——框架在frontier scale上产出sensible\n    results。不提供quantitative validation(无ground truth)。 置于appendix或supplementary material。\n\n    '\n- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: 'Degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat + Self-Critique, 无logits/embeddings)\n    for closed-weight models。消融量化2-signal vs 4-signal calibration accuracy gap。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    composite_2signal_auc_d005: 0.568\n    composite_2signal_auc_d025: 0.55\n    gamma_2signal_mean: 0.15\n    gamma_2signal_sd: 0.28\n    gamma_2signal_ci_excludes_zero: false\n    mae_calibrated_2signal_pp: 7.2\n    mae_vs_4signal_gap_pp: 3.0\n    ci_coverage_95pct: 78\n    ci_width_pp: 16.5\n    kendall_tau: 0.65\n    calibration_useful: false\n  result_rationale: '2-signal mode仅使用ConStat(performance gap)和Self-Critique(entropy)。\n    在median tier下，ConStat AUC ~0.61-0.64 at 1.5B/3B，Self-Critique ~0.50-0.52。RRF composite\n    ~0.57——处于structural identifiability threshold(AUC≥0.55)但远低于practical threshold(AUC≥0.70)。\n\n    Fisher Info at AUC=0.57: I(γ) ≈ 3400 (from fisher_info_verification.json 的AUC\n    sweep interpolation)。但这是conditional on known item parameters。 Marginal posterior会更宽——exp-004\n    simulation在AUC=0.55/N=20时 CI width=13.3pp，在N=26 with AUC=0.57 → CI width ~15-17pp。\n\n    γ posterior wide enough to include 0 → calibration无法有效区分 contaminated和clean scores。MAE\n    7.2pp(vs 4-signal 4.2pp)—— degradation 3.0pp。CI coverage drops to 78%(CIs too\n    narrow relative to actual error因为point estimate更biased)。\n\n    Kendall tau 0.65(vs 4-signal 0.80)：ranking preservation差因为 noisy exposure scores导致错误的contamination\n    attribution。\n\n    结论：closed-weight mode在当前信号条件下不可用(not useful)。 这是honest limitation——论文报告为\"closed-weight\n    applicability requires stronger signals than currently available\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 2-signal vs 4-signal Calibration Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - 4-signal\n    - 2-signal\n    - Delta\n    rows:\n    - - Composite AUC (d005)\n      - 0.979\n      - 0.568\n      - -0.411\n    - - MAE (pp)\n      - 4.2\n      - 7.2\n      - 3.0\n    - - 95% Coverage\n      - 85%\n      - 78%\n      - -7%\n    - - CI Width (pp)\n      - 11.3\n      - 16.5\n      - 5.2\n    - - Kendall τ\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.65\n      - -0.15\n    - - γ CI excludes 0 rate\n      - 62.5%\n      - 12.5%\n      - -50%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: 4-signal vs 2-signal在每个metric上的对比。所有指标4-signal显著优于2-signal。'\n  analysis: '2-signal mode的失败直接map到Fisher Info identifiability framework： AUC 0.57\n    < practical threshold 0.70 → calibration unreliable。 这是C3(identifiability)的validation\n    case——理论预测在此AUC regime下 calibration ineffective，实验证实。论文处理：report as P2 ablation\n    in appendix，引用Fisher Info analysis解释为何不work。 Frame as \"future work: when better\n    closed-weight signals become available (e.g., improved ConStat variants), the\n    framework is ready.\"\n\n    '\n- name: simulation_identifiability_sweep\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '144-condition synthetic-data sweep(已完成48/120 runs)的full completion\n    预测。AUC(0.55-0.90) × N_models(20-200) × prior × exposure_type。 包含SBC diagnostic和Fisher\n    Info matrix analysis。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_conditions: 120\n    total_runs_with_seeds: 1200\n    gamma_rmse_auc080_n50: 0.032\n    gamma_rmse_auc055_n20: 0.068\n    gamma_rmse_auc065_n50: 0.048\n    gamma_rmse_auc090_n100: 0.018\n    ci_width_auc080_n50_pp: 12.8\n    ci_width_auc055_n20_pp: 13.3\n    ci_width_auc065_n50_pp: 10.2\n    ci_width_auc090_n100_pp: 7.5\n    ci_coverage_n20_pct: 84\n    ci_coverage_n50_pct: 92\n    ci_coverage_n100_pct: 96\n    structural_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.55\n    practical_identifiability_threshold_auc: 0.7\n    sqrt_n_scaling_confirmed: true\n    sqrt_n_scaling_deviation_pct: 4\n    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue_n20: 0.03\n    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue_n50: 0.08\n    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue_n100: 0.35\n    growing_pains_preestimation_benefit_pp: 1.2\n    fisher_info_theory_empirical_ratio: 0.998\n    prior_sensitivity_gamma_shift_max: 0.04\n    cpu_hours_total: 800\n  result_rationale: \"已完成的48 runs (AUC 0.55/0.80 × N 20/50/100)确立了core findings： -\\\n    \\ γ bias ≤ 0.02, RMSE ≤ 0.04 at AUC=0.80 - 1/√N scaling within 4% - 100% power\\\n    \\ (all runs detect γ≠0) - CI width inflation ratio 1.81-1.95× at AUC 0.80 vs 0.55\\n\\\n    剩余72 runs (AUC 0.65/0.90)将填充中间和高端： - AUC 0.65: 介于0.55和0.80之间。RMSE ~0.048 at N=50(插值)。\\n\\\n    \\  这个AUC regime对应\\\"marginal signal quality\\\"——S3(ConStat)\\n  在1.5B/3B的实测AUC。CI\\\n    \\ width ~10pp at N=50。\\n  Coverage: ~88% at N=50(低于nominal但好于N=20的84%)。\\n- AUC\\\n    \\ 0.90: near-perfect signal。RMSE <0.02 at N=100。\\n  CI width ~7.5pp。Coverage approaches\\\n    \\ 95%+ at N≥50。\\n  但这个regime在现实中只有S1 embedding达到(AUC~0.97)。\\n\\nSBC diagnostic:\\\n    \\ N=20时rank histogram偏态(p=0.03)指向underdispersion—— posterior too narrow relative\\\n    \\ to prior predictive。这is consistent with the real-data coverage gap (85% vs 95%)。N≥50时SBC\\\n    \\ passes (p>0.05)。 说明coverage gap partly from insufficient N_models。\\nFisher Info\\\n    \\ theory-empirical ratio 0.998(从fisher_info_verification.json 已确认)。The theoretical\\\n    \\ framework is validated。\\nGrowing Pains pre-estimation: at N=20, using pre-estimated\\\n    \\ item parameters (from larger dataset) reduces CI width by ~1.2pp。 Marginal benefit\\\n    \\ — not enough to close the coverage gap alone。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: Identifiability Phase Diagram (γ RMSE)\n    columns:\n    - AUC\\N_models\n    - '20'\n    - '50'\n    - '100'\n    - '200'\n    rows:\n    - - '0.55'\n      - 0.068\n      - 0.042\n      - 0.03\n      - 0.021\n    - - '0.65'\n      - 0.055\n      - 0.035\n      - 0.025\n      - 0.018\n    - - '0.80'\n      - 0.045\n      - 0.032\n      - 0.022\n      - 0.015\n    - - '0.90'\n      - 0.038\n      - 0.025\n      - 0.018\n      - 0.012\n  - name: 95% CI Width (pp)\n    columns:\n    - AUC\\N_models\n    - '20'\n    - '50'\n    - '100'\n    - '200'\n    rows:\n    - - '0.55'\n      - 13.3\n      - 8.9\n      - 6.5\n      - 4.6\n    - - '0.65'\n      - 11.5\n      - 7.8\n      - 5.6\n      - 4.0\n    - - '0.80'\n      - 14.2\n      - 9.8\n      - 7.2\n      - 5.1\n    - - '0.90'\n      - 12.8\n      - 8.5\n      - 6.2\n      - 4.4\n  - name: CI Coverage at 95% Nominal\n    columns:\n    - AUC\\N_models\n    - '20'\n    - '50'\n    - '100'\n    - '200'\n    rows:\n    - - '0.55'\n      - 82%\n      - 90%\n      - 95%\n      - 96%\n    - - '0.65'\n      - 84%\n      - 91%\n      - 95%\n      - 96%\n    - - '0.80'\n      - 86%\n      - 93%\n      - 96%\n      - 97%\n    - - '0.90'\n      - 88%\n      - 94%\n      - 97%\n      - 98%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Identifiability phase diagram (Figure 4 of paper): x=AUC, y=N_models, color=γ\n    RMSE。等高线标注structural(RMSE<0.10)和practical(RMSE<0.04)边界。当前实验条件(AUC~0.97, N~26)用star标注，落在practical\n    threshold内但边缘。'\n  - '1/√N scaling plot: log(N) vs log(CI_width)，4条线对应4个AUC水平。斜率均接近-0.5(理论值)。'\n  analysis: \"Simulation sweep提供C3(identifiability)的full empirical backing。 Key paper-ready\\\n    \\ claims: (1) Structural identifiability at AUC≥0.55(γ always recoverable in principle)\\\n    \\ (2) Practical identifiability at AUC≥0.70 and N≥50(RMSE<0.04, coverage>90%)\\\n    \\ (3) Current experimental condition (AUC~0.97 S1, N~26) is at the edge of\\n \\\n    \\   practical identifiability — γ recoverable but CI relatively wide\\n(4) 1/√N\\\n    \\ scaling validated — doubling N cuts CI width by ~30% (5) Coverage gap at N=20\\\n    \\ diagnosed via SBC as insufficient sample size effect Phase diagram是论文的most impactful\\\n    \\ figure之一——给practitioner clear guidance on \\\"when can you trust calibration results\\\"\\\n    。\\n\"\n- name: noise_propagation_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: '(A) ME model扩展Stan model处理exposure as noisy observation。 (B) Post-hoc\n    noise injection测量CI widening。评估ME model是否 closes coverage gap。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    me_model_converges: true\n    me_model_gamma_bias_pct: 55\n    simple_model_gamma_bias_pct: 52\n    me_model_coverage_95pct: 87\n    simple_model_coverage_95pct: 82\n    me_model_coverage_improvement_pp: 5\n    me_model_ci_width_pp: 12.8\n    simple_model_ci_width_pp: 10.5\n    me_model_ci_width_increase_pp: 2.3\n    noise_1x_gamma_rmse: 0.035\n    noise_15x_gamma_rmse: 0.052\n    noise_2x_gamma_rmse: 0.078\n    noise_2x_ci_widening_factor: 1.45\n    sigma_e_estimated_sft: 0.15\n    sigma_e_estimated_rl: 0.4\n    me_model_closes_coverage_gap: false\n    fit_time_multiplier_vs_simple: 3.2\n    cpu_hours_total: 120\n  result_rationale: 'exp-005 v2已显示ME model的gamma bias 59.2%(simple model 57.5%)——\n    ME model不仅不减少bias，反而略微增加。这是因为ME model adds latent τ layer，增加了parameter space但N_models=30不足以\n    同时估计σ_e和τ_ij。\n\n    Median tier预测ME model对coverage的改善有限(+5pp, 82→87%)。 改善来自CI widening(+2.3pp width)——ME\n    model的uncertainty propagation使CIs更宽，mechanically提高coverage，但不修复 underlying bias。Coverage\n    gap从13pp(82% vs 95%)缩小到8pp(87% vs 95%)， 未fully close。\n\n    Bias方向(positive, ~55%): exposure scores有measurement error时， 观察到的exposure-performance\n    correlation被attenuate(classical measurement error attenuation)。但IRT model不是simple\n    regression—— γ posterior也受prior和item parameters影响。Net effect: moderate positive\n    bias因为noisy exposure scores部分correlate with ability θ (confounding)。\n\n    Post-hoc noise injection: 逐步增加noise level(1×/1.5×/2×) empirically maps noise→degradation曲线。At\n    2× noise, CI widening factor 1.45(理论值from fisher_info_verification.json attenuation_theory\n    ~0.79 at σ_e=0.3 → CI width ∝ 1/√I → 1.13×。 但实际widening更大因为bias compounds with\n    variance)。\n\n    σ_e估计：SFT scenario的exposure score noise较低(σ_e≈0.15， S1 signal在SFT controlled conditions下很reliable)。\n    RL scenario更高(σ_e≈0.40，S1 AUC降到0.58)。 这quantifies为何RL calibration的CI比SFT宽得多。\n\n    ME model不作为primary model的decision confirmed: improvement insufficient to justify\n    3.2× computation cost。 Simple model为主，ME为ablation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Simple vs ME Model Comparison (N=30, AUC=0.80 simulation)\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Simple\n    - ME_model\n    - Delta\n    rows:\n    - - γ bias (%)\n      - 52\n      - 55\n      - 3\n    - - γ RMSE\n      - 0.032\n      - 0.038\n      - 0.006\n    - - 95% Coverage\n      - 82%\n      - 87%\n      - +5%\n    - - CI Width (pp)\n      - 10.5\n      - 12.8\n      - 2.3\n    - - Fit time (min)\n      - 25\n      - 80\n      - ×3.2\n  - name: Noise Injection Degradation\n    columns:\n    - Noise_level\n    - γ_RMSE\n    - CI_width_pp\n    - Coverage_95\n    rows:\n    - - 1× (matched)\n      - 0.035\n      - 11.2\n      - 84%\n    - - 1.5×\n      - 0.052\n      - 13.5\n      - 86%\n    - - 2×\n      - 0.078\n      - 16.2\n      - 88%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Noise level vs CI width: 单调递增曲线，标注SFT和RL operating points。SFT在1×附近(窄CI)，RL在2-3×附近(宽CI)。Fisher\n    Info theoretical curve overlay。'\n  analysis: 'ME model is a partial solution: widens CIs in the right direction but\n    doesn''t fix the fundamental bias from confounding (θ-exposure correlation). Coverage\n    improvement +5pp is real but insufficient. Paper strategy: report as ablation,\n    discuss why ME model underperforms expectations (N too small for τ identification,\n    confounding not modeled). This motivates future work on hierarchical models with\n    explicit confounding structure.'\n","numLines":1390,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1390}}}
