_eval_05B_d000_s42_v4: 0% dosage 0.5B s42 baseline eval (v4, 清理后干净重提交)（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 5 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_001_eval_15B_aligned_batch** (success): 1.5B aligned-format eval batch (D017): d000/d005/d100 × original + paraphrase. Formal analysis results for 1.5B scale dose-response.\\\\n- **exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k** (success): GSM8K (1319 items, ~5300 params) NUTS feasibility validation. If warmup produces samples within 2h → NUTS viable for small benchmarks. Else → ADVI fallback. ← 基于 exp_006_irt_05B_v1\\\\n- **exp_001_eval_15B_d100_aligned** (success): 1.5B d100 aligned eval: full contamination dosage performance on original benchmarks (aligned format)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 43 / 负向 0 / 失败 16 / 共 61\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ncqa1-21977: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_15B_d000_s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_100pct_05B: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d005_05B: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d100_15B: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_004_sim_sweep: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_005_noise_prop: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_005_noise_prop_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d025_05B: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d025_05B_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_006_irt_05B: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned_v3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_006_irt_05B_v1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3084, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wm7VEapapuGwRnFKZTB5zr","session_id":"65318bdd-9a4d-466f-be88-bd9a1ec29eb0","uuid":"9e4d8627-7928-415b-befb-c80d592440ac","timestamp":"2026-05-14T20:00:45.749Z"}
